<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Begyu-Dɩrɛ Bɔɔ Gɩkpa-Gyangbasɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Be</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ Gɩkpa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ditenikwaa daanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi bɩkyan bɩ san bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ dan ditenikwaa gepepe fɔ, ma gɛtɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan bee tin wɔ ayan gba fɔ, ɛn mɩnɩ taà nɩ talɩ olili. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Okoro wɔ bɛsaranyan bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, yɛ taa len ɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ ɛn nyɩ̀ ete fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ sara aakʋn fɔ èè ton wɔ̀. Ɛɛ̀ dʋrɔ aakʋn, fɔ awɔ miinfonte aa koro gàà ya wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ma bugiti ɛsʋgʋgyan ma ɔmɩrɩ Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ, gɛ be we Abisagi, Sunam-nanɩ ɛkɩ, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ mɔma egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Ɛsʋgʋgyan fɔ ɛ̀ ba ɔmɩrɩ gepepe. Ɛ nya wo koro, gɛ ɛ sʋma wɔ. Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn dʋrɔ ma ɛwɔ gite ma gɩna nya.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adoniya ɛ sɩ̀ koro bugyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Fɔ Adoniya gɛtɛ wɔna n di Hagiti fɔ, ɛ bʋma koro gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ, nan bɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ pɩna tiiramisan ɛbɛ yaabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ koro, ma bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50), gɛtɛ baà tì gyegeye wɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Ɛ̀ ba ɔmɩrɩ gepepe, gɛ ɛwɔ n tɛrɛma Abisalom gewo gaanɩ. Wote Dafidi ɛn tɛ fa wɔ nya, èè lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a mɛ ade nyayɩ abɛɛ lɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Duwi dɩkɩ Adoniya ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Seruya wobi Yowabi, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata, gɛ be yera alɛ baà kpà wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Mɔ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Yohoyada wobi Benaya, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan, ma Simeyi, ma Reyi, ma Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ wɔ fɔ, bɛn ka koro fɩya ma Adoniya. <verse eid="1KI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Duwi dɩkɩ Adoniya e wolo bɛyɛran, ma bɛkwɔ-teni, ma bɛkwɔ atan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ayo fɔ ɛ tɛ gedi ɛwa dɩtaa dɩɩpɩ, gbɛma En-Rogeli. Gɛ e kpèlè wonobi ɛbɛ, ma wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ powu, gɛtɛ bè di egyu-dɩrɛ bebi fɔ, ma Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi powu, <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />mɔ en kpèlè Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan, abɛɛ Benaya, abɛɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ wɔ fɔ, abɛɛ wonobi Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Gɛ Natan e lila Solomon wɔna Batiseba alan, &lt;&lt;A nʋn gɛtɛ Adoniya, Hagiti wobi e biligi egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ tiifonte Dafidi ɛn nyɩ̀ waanɩ? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Nkele, yɛ nan tɛ wɔ̀ amɩnlɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ aà ka a to awɔ gbagba aa nkpa ma aabi Solomon wo yo. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />San egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wakʋn nkenkele nyawʋ, fɔ àà ma lila wɔ alan, &lt;Oo! miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ, an kan ntam tɛ mɩ alɛ, miinbi Solomon nan di bugyu aa diku dɩɩ gama, gɛ ɛɛ̀ sara aa gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro? Anʋn yii koro gɛ nkele Adoniya na bɛ mɛ egyu?&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Gengyi à sa dʋkɔ aa tabʋrʋ ma egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ, nmɩ gbagba nan be gyu, gɛ nan dɔ̀ n gyaga aanyun-gyebi fɔ yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Okoro Batiseba ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ wo dikwo daanɩ. (Nkele egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dan gepepe, gɛ Abisagi Sunam-sʋgʋgyan fɔ n tɛ nya wo koro.) <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Gɛ Batiseba ɛ waran e kura egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">&lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ aa len?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Gɛ Batiseba ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, awɔ gbagba na kan ntam Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ diyere dii koro a tɛ nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan alan, &lt;Aabi Solomon nan di bugyu miin diku dɩɩ gama, gɛ ɛwɔ nan sara miin gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Mɔ nkele, Adoniya na bɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ awɔ, miinfonte an nyɩ̀ waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Ɛ ka bɛkwɔ-teni, ma bɛkwɔ atan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ayo, ma bɛyɛran kpekpesi ɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ e kpèlè wonobi ma wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè di awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ aa bebi fɔ powu, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Yowabi e tuma, mɔ en kpèlè aasaranyan Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ, Isareli bete powu bɛɛ nya aa bʋnʋn gɛtɛ aà dɔ̀ bɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu e sere a gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, gengyi awɔ miinfonte a bɔ a ku fɔ, baà nya nmɩ ma miinbi Solomon anlɛ bɛnɩ-kpen.<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Gɛtɛ Batiseba ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ma egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan e be gyu dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan ɛ̀ sa nfan!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Natan ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ waran e kura ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Gɛ Natan ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ, awɔ na dɔ̀ a tana alɛ, Adoniya eè di bugyu aa gama, gɛ ɛwɔ nan sara aa gigyu-bɩya gii koro? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Yema ǹdò, Adoniya ɛ waran ɛ san En-Rogeli, gɛ ɛ ka bɛkwɔ-teni, ma bɛkwɔ atan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ayo, ma bɛyɛran kpekpesi ɛ tɛ gedi. Gɛ e kpèlè aa bebi powu, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Yowabi, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata. Nkenkele nyawʋ, bee di, gɛ bɛɛ nyʋn, gɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ Adoniya, sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Mɔ en kpèlè nmɩ, aasaranyan, ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Yehoyada wobi Benaya, ma aasaranyan Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Okoro wù di gɛ awɔ miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ aa gelenbi gaanɩ gɛ ade nyayɩ i sere, gɛ an yɛ aa bɛsaranyan bàà nyɩnla ɛwɔ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu aa gama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ sɩ̀ Solomon bugyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè Batiseba ɩ tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e be yela egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="1KI 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ kan ntam ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa, gɛ e tiri mɩ e ye dɩyɩyɛ-kamasɛ daanɩ lɛ alɛ, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ǹdò nan mɛ ade gɛtɛ na kan ntam na tɛ wɔ̀ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ diyere dii koro alɛ aabi Solomon nan di bugyu mɩɩn gama, gɛ ɛwɔ nan sara miin gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Batiseba ɛ waran e kura egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Gɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan, ma Yehoyada wobi Benaya ɩ tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ be be gyu egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè mɩɩn dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ i tuma, ɩ ka miinbi Solomon ɩ gyaga nmɩ gbagba mɩɩn dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dii koro, fɔ yàà ka wɔ ɩ waran ɩ san Gihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Dʋkɔ gɛ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan baà sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ Isareli wogyu. Ɩ fʋn dɩkantan, fɔ yàà gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu Solomon, sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, ɩ tɛrɛma wɔ ɩ ba, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ̀ bʋn sara miin gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro fɔ èè di bugyu miin didin. Yema na tiri wɔ gɛtɛ èè di bugyu Isareli, ma Yuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Yehoyada wobi Benaya e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Wàà ba waanɩ! Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ ade nyayɩ yàà ba waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sara ma miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛɛ̀ sara ma Solomon, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bʋma wo gigyu-bɩya fɔ gatala da miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi woyo fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan, ma Yohoyadi wobi Benaya, ma Kereti bete, ma Peleti bete bɛ waran bɛ san, gɛ bɛ ma sɩ̀ Solomon bugyu, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ gyaga egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dii koro gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ san Gihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Dʋkɔ gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki ɛ ka diyela gɛtɛ bʋnɔ bʋ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ e ye Dɩyan dii Dikwo fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ sʋrʋ Solomon. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ fʋn dɩkantan gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon, sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ̀ nyɩma wɔ bɛɛ fʋn akantan, gɛ bee di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ baafala fɔ ɩ yɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gi kpenti.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ e kpèlè e tuma wakʋn fɔ powu bɛ nʋn afala nyayɩ, ɔya gɛtɛ be di be were fɔ. Gɛ gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ nʋn akantan fɔ, e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaafala gɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ gɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Gɛtɛ ɛn tɛ tabʋrʋ were fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata wobi Yonatan e gyu baakʋn. Ɛwʋ gɛ Adoniya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gyu ba! Yema à di gɛ ɛnɩ-kpara. Ǹ nyɩ gɛtɛ à de gɛ ade-kpara à san.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Mɔ Yonatan e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Adoniya alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa! miin de ade-kpara n san. Tiifonte egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ sɩ̀ Solomon bugyu! <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa ɛwɔ Solomon ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan, ma Yohoyadi wobi Benaya, ma Kereti bete, ma Peleti bete, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ gyaga egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan bɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ Gihon. Bɛ ka ɔsɛ wuu gedi be ye dʋkɔ, gɛ ditele fɔ powu di to ma ɔwʋlʋ. Gɛlɛ gaafala gɛ ɩ nʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Okoro nkenkele Solomon n si gugyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ ma tɛ tiifonte, egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi duyu-kpara bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Aa Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ Solomon diyere dàà ye da aayo, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bʋma wo gigyu-bɩya gatala da aayo fɔ.&gt; Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ warama koro ɛ sʋma Wurubwarɛ wo difenge dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Gesila gɩ kʋtʋma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ yɛ mɩɩn bʋnʋn bu we ɛwɔ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu mɩɩn gama fɔ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Nyawʋ wʋ yɛ gɩsaa gi ton bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Adoniya e kpèlè fɔ powu, gɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛ ka ma wosele. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Mɔ Adoniya è serenti Solomon wuu koro, ɛ san ɛ ma gye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gaayola fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Gɛ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Adoniya è serenti egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon okoro, ɛ ma gye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gaayola fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Yɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ̀ɛ̀ kan ntam ǹdò dɔ̀ alɛ, ɛn nan ka tata e wolo nmɩ, wɔsaranyan.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi gɛ eè di nʋnkwarɩ fɔ, wo diyungu-kɩlɩn gba dɩn nan nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa, mɔ gengyi gɛ ade-kpen ɩ̀ sa wanɩ fɔ, eè ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ sa bɛnɩ, gɛ bɛ ma ka Adoniya be ye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro bɛ ba. Gɛ Adoniya ɛ bɛ waran e kura egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon bʋnʋn, gɛ Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San aa dɩkpaara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi gɛtabʋrʋ-kurumakyɛɛ tɛ Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi diku dɩ gbɛma fɔ, ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ wobi Solomon alan, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />&lt;&lt;Ɔya wʋ nɩma gɛtɛ nan ku anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ powu bee ku fɔ. Okoro yela kin-kin, fɔ àà sa geteni, <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />fɔ àà mɛ ade gɛtɛ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ fɔ. San wo-isele yaanɩ, fɔ àà ton wade-wùlàlɛ, ma wo-ise, ma wade-lenlɛ yaanɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Mose wo-ise yaanɩ fɔ. Gɛlɛ fɔ ade powu gɛtɛ aà mɛ, ma ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aà san fɔ waà sere gepe wʋ tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Fɔ Yahwe eè ton wade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ mɩ alan, &lt;Gengyi aa gewo-tama gii bebi bɛ̀ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ bɛ, gɛ gengyi bɛ̀ ka boo-ituru powu ma bɔɔ bɛkala, be di nʋnkwarɩ bɛ tɛ mɩ fɔ, aa dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ nan tì di bugyu ɔya-kamasɛ Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />Gɛ Dafidi e biri ɛ dɔ̀ Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele mɔ, à nyɩ̀ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ Seruya wobi Yowabi ɛ mɛ mɩ. E wolo mɩɩn bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ bɛnyɔɔ. Ɛbɛ n di Neri wobi Abine, ma Yete wobi Amasa. E wolo bɛ olila wʋʋya waanɩ anlɛ bɛ nʋ̀n gɛ bɩtà ɛ ka e le ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be wolo akpa yɩɩya waanɩ fɔ wuu gutoro. E wolo bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛn nyɩ ade ɩkɩ, gɛ na yɛ n tola wuu ditola gɛ n te we wʋʋ dɩfana. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Okoro ka gɛsɛyɩ mɛ wɔ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ aà mɛ wɔ, mɔ kara yɛ wɔ èè ku Wurubwarɛ diku. <verse eid="1KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />Mɔ tiri gelen wùlà Basilayi gɛtɛ e ye Gileyadi fɔ, fɔ àà yɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà di ma awɔ fɔ. Yema ɛbɛ na kpa mɩ ɔya gɛtɛ n te serenti nan ye aadɩrɛ Abisalom wakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Biri kʋna Gera wobi Simeyi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Bahurim ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. Ɛ fwala mɩ duwi gɛtɛ na ye Yerusalem gɛ n tɛ fɔrɔ Mahanayim ditele fɔ. Ɔya gɛtɛ ɛ waran e be tuma mɩ Yodan getu gaanɩ fɔ, na ka Yahwe Diyere nan kan ntam na tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;Mɩn nan wolo wɔ̀.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Okoro nkele, kara nya wɔ anlɛ ɛn nyɩ ade-ɩkɩ. À di gɛsɛyɩ gɩɩnɩ, à nyɩ gɩnyan gɛtɛ aà mɛ wɔ. Nya gɛtɛ èè ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Dafidi e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Dafidi e di bugyu bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa powu gii koro. E di bugyu bɩkyan kwarankɩ Hebron, gɛ ɛ mɛ bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo bisiyee Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Okoro Solomon ɛ sara wote Dafidi gigyu-bɩya gii koro, gɛ wo bugyu bu yela gepepe.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adoniya diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Wʋ bɛ ba gɛtɛ Agiti wobi Adoniya ɛ bɛ san Solomon wɔna Batiseba wakʋn. Gɛ Batiseba e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;A ba olila waanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan,&lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, na ba olila waanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ ba ade ɩkɩ gɛtɛ nte len nan dɔ̀ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Batiseba ɛ kyaga wuu koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tabʋrʋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Gɛ Adoniya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ gbagba à nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ nafɔ bugyu fɔ bù di gɛ miinyo, gɛ Isareli powu ɛɛ nya mɩɩn bʋnʋn gɛtɛ nan mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ. Mɔ ade i foma gɛ bugyu fɔ bu biligi miinobi woyo, yema Yahwe na ka bʋ ɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Nkele n te len nan lila wɔ̀ ade ɩkɩ. Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, kara berema mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Batiseba ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tabʋrʋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Gɛ Adoniya ɛ kyaga wuu koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Lila egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon tɛ mɩ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka Sunami-na Abisagi ɛ tɛ mɩ, nan to gɩna. N nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ gengyi awɔ à lila wɔ ade ɩkɩ fɔ, ɛn nan terema.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Gɛ Batiseba ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ, nan tabʋrʋ ma egyu-dɩrɛ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Gɛtɛ Batiseba ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wakʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma dɔ̀ wɔ Adoniya wade lila fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɔ e tuma wɔ, gɛ ɛ waran e kura wɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ bɛ sara wo gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro. Ɛ yɛ bɛ ka gigyu-bɩya bɛ mɔma wɔna, gɛ ɛ sara wologyi-lɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Gɛ Batiseba ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ bɛ fɔ wɔ̀ ade bɛrɛɛ ɩkɩ. Kara terema tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩnna lila aade fɔ, mɩɩn nan terema n tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Gɛ Batiseba alan, &lt;&lt;Ka Sunami-na Abisagi tɛ aadɩrɛ Adoniya è to gɩna.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔna alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len nan ka Sunami-na Abisagi n tɛ mɩɩndɩrɛ Adoniya èè to gɩna? Ɛwʋ bɩrɛ lila bugyu fɔ mɔ tɛ wɔ, yema è di gɛ mɩɩndɩrɛ. Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata, ma Seruya wobi Yowabi gɛtɛ è di bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɛɛ kpà wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ ka Yahwe ɛ kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi Adoniya ɛn ka wɔ nkpa le ade gɛtɛ e lila lɛ yii gutoro fɔ, Yahwe e wolo mɩ. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ mɩ miinte Dafidi giigyu-bɩya gii koro gɛ ɛ tɛ mɩ dɩkpaara, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ alɛ, wù di gɛtɛ bàà wolo Adoniya ǹdò.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ sa Yohoyadi wobi Benaya, gɛ ɛ ma wolo wɔ.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Abiyata alan, &lt;&lt;Biri san aa ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Anatoti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. Nafɔ wù di gɛtɛ àà ku mɔ mɩn nan wolo wɔ nkenkele, yema a tola Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ miinte Dafidi bʋnʋn, gɛ a we dɩfana kpekpesi a fɩya ma miinte.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Okoro Solomon e tiri Abiyata e ye Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩɩ gʋtʋn gaanɩ. Gɛ nyawʋ wʋ yɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Silo ka dama Eli dɩkpaara dii koro fɔ wʋ ba waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ ɩ tàmà Adoniya ma Abiyata fɔ, e serenti ɛ san Yahwe Dɩyan dii Dikwo-Dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ma gye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gaayela fɔ. Yema ɛwɔ mɔ e yela Adoniya gama e kere Abisalom ɛ ya. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Gɛ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Yowabi e serenti ɛ san Yahwe Dɩyan dii Dikwo fɔ daanɩ gɛ ɛ̀ sa gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ bɩlan baanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ Yehoyada wobi Benaya alan, &lt;&lt;San, ma wolo wɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Okoro Benaya e gyu Yahwe Dɩyan dii Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu alan, &lt;Ye ba!&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Mɔ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, nan ku nfan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Gɛ Benaya e birima ade powu gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ ɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anlɛ gɛ Yowabi e tiri ade yiinyun ɛ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Benaya alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Wolo wɔ, fɔ àà lò wɔ! Fɔ wàà tiri nmɩ ma mɩɩn dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ wu ye bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ ade-ɩkɩ yaanɩ gɛ e wolo bɛ fɔ wuu giten-tiira gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Yahwe ɛɛ̀ yɛ nkalan gɛtɛ ɛ da e lulu fɔ wàà biri wo duyu dii koro. Yema e wolo bɛnɩ bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ miinte Dafidi ɛɛn nyɩ̀ waanɩ. Ɛbɛ n di Neri wobi Abine gɛtɛ è di Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋndɩrɛ, ma Yete wobi Amasa gɛtɛ è di Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋndɩrɛ. Bɛ bɛnyɔɔ powu baade ɩ̀ tʋna da wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɔɔ nkalan waà tola Yowabi ma wɔ wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ gakpaakpa. Mɔ Yahwe wolila waà sara Dafidi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ ma wɔ dɩkpaara ma wo bugyu baanɩ Gakpaakpa. <verse eid="1KI 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Gɛ Yohoyadi wobi Benaya ɛ ma wolo Yowabi gɛ be lò wɔ ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, otonkuma waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka Yohoyada wobi Benaya ɛ mɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ e sere Yowabi bɩsɩrɩ, gɛ ɛ mɛ Sadoki gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ e sere Abiyata bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa be kpèlè Simeyi bɛ tɛ wɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Sere dɩkpaara tɛ aa koro Yerusalem, fɔ àà sara daanɩ. Kara ye dʋkɔ san ɔkankɩ fɩya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Yema duwi gɛtɛ aà ye dʋkɔ a kààrà Kidiron dɩtagba fɔ, aà ku, gɛ aa nkalan waà biri awɔ gbagba aa duyu dii koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Gɛ Simeyi ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ. Nmɩ, aasaranyan, nan mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ awɔ miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Simeyi ɛ sara Yerusalem ɔya kpekpesi.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Mɔ Bɩkyan bisiyee bʋʋ gama fɔ, Simeyi bɛdɩ bɛnyɔɔ be serenti bɛ san Maaka wobi Akisi gɛtɛ è di Gati wogyu fɔ wakʋn. Gɛtɛ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Simeyi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, aa bɛdɩ fɔ bɛ̀ sa Gati.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Okoro Simeyi ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ pɩna dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, gɛ ɛ san Akisi wakʋn Gati fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma bugiti wɔ bɛdɩ̀ fɔ. E we bɛ gɛ e birima bɛ e ye Gati ɛ ba wɔlɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ nʋn alɛ Simeyi e ye Yerusalem ɛ san Gati gɛ e biri ɛ ba fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa bɛ ma kpèlè Simeyi bɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn yɛ wɔ a kan ntam Yahwe diyere daanɩ, gɛ na sʋ wɔ̀ na sa alɛ, &lt;Duwi gɛtɛ aà ye a san ɔkankɩ fɔ, aà ku?&gt; Gɛ a dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;Ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ, ɩ̀ kɔlɔ, nan di yii koro.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ an di ntam gɛtɛ a kan Yahwe diyere daanɩ fɔ, àà bu miinse gɛtɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ nɩ dɔ̀ Simeyi alan, &lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ aaturu waanɩ ade-kpen powu gɛtɛ a mɛ miinte Dafidi fɔ. Nkele Yahwe eè le wɔ̀ aade-kpen gɛtɛ a mɛ fɔ powu yii gutoro. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Mɔ nmɩ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon bɩrɛ, Yahwe eè hira mɩ, gɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ Dafidi bugyu baà yela gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Yehoyada wobi Benaya alɛ ɛ ma wolo Simeyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Okoro Solomon bugyu fɔ bu yela gepepe.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon e tiri onyun ɛ fɔ gɛsɛyɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Solomon ɛ mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn ma Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ Farawo, gɛ e to wobi-nanɩbi gɩna. Ɛ ka wɔ ɛ ba Dafidi Ditele fɔ daanɩ, ka ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ e sere wo digyukpaara, ma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ, ma ɔpɔrɩ e silin Yerusalem ditele fɔ e were. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ tɛ gɛ gedi asʋmakʋn-kperen-kperen yaanɩ, yema waanɩ fɔ, ben te sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ Yahwe diyere daanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomon e len Yahwe wade gepepe, gɛ ɛ san wote Dafidi wo-isele yaanɩ. Mɔ fɔ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛɛ tɛ gedi, ma olifwi gekuma gii gedi, asʋmakʋn yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ san Gibeyon ditele ɛ ma tɛ gedi, yema dʋkɔ n di gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn-dɩrɛ. Gɛ Solomon ɛ ka bɛnan ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi kpekpesi gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɩtɔkɔ gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ̀ sa Gibeyon fɔ Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà wɔ okute waanɩ odente, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Lila gɩnyan gɛtɛ à len nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Gɛ Solomon e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;A tiri aa gelen-dɩrɛ a wùlà aasaranyan, miinte Dafidi yema e to wɔ e di gɛ e di nʋnkwarɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ gɛ wade powu ɩ tʋna aa bʋnʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu gelen-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ ke gɛ a ka mɩ a tɛ wɔ gɛtɛ nan sara wo gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro ǹdò wuu duwi lɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Nkele, Oo! Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, a sɩ̀ nmɩ aasaranyan bugyu a sere miinte Dafidi gɩsɩrɩ, mɔ ǹ di gɛ ebi, gɛ mɩɩn nyɩ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ nan ka n ton miin bugyu fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Nya, nmɩ aasaranyan n sa ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ awɔ gbagba a tiri a mɛ aayo ɛbɛ fɔ. Be di bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ ɛ kalan. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Okoro tɛ nmɩ aasaranyan gɛsɛyɩ gɛtɛ nan ka n ton bugyu fɔ ma buusele n tɛ aa bɛnɩ, fɔ nan talɩ n we ade-kpen ma ade-kpara n nyɩnla. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, ɛnyan nan talɩ e gyegeye aa bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan nyadɩ dɩɩ bʋnʋn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Gɛ wʋ mɛ Yahwe ɔsɛ gɛtɛ Solomon e lila ade nyayɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Okoro Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ ade nyayɩ gɛ a lila, gɛ an lila nkpa ma ɔfɔ, abɛɛ koro gaanyan, abɛɛ aa bɛkyʋnlɛ boo diku, mɔ a lila gɛ gɛsɛyɩ, ma ade-yɩɩ-gɛkɛrɛ-nya, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ aà ka a dɔ̀ gɔdɔ ma giisele okoro, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />nan mɛ ade gɛtɛ a lila fɔ. Nya, nan tɛ wɔ̀ gɛsɛyɩ, ma gɛkɛrɛ-ade-nya, gɛtɛ ɛkɩ en wura gaakɩ nya, gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn nan wura gaakɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Gɛ nan biri n fɩya wɔ̀ anyan gɛtɛ an lila gba. Nan tɛ wɔ̀ gɩkyɩnyɩn ma gebù gɛtɛ aa nkpa awi powu yaanɩ fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ nan talɩ ɛ kɛrɛ ma awɔ. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Gɛ gengyi à san mii-isele yaanɩ, gɛ à bu maade-wùlàlɛ ma mii-ise anlɛ gɛtɛ aate Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ, nan tɛ wɔ̀ nkpa ma ɔfɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ɛ lama, gɛ e we gɛtɛ wù di gɛ okute. E biri ɛ san Yerusalem, gɛ e yela Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi ma olila wuu gedi, gɛ ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi powu be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon ɛ ka gɛsɛyɩ ɛ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ ma giisele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Duwi dɩkɩ fotoli bɛnanɩ bɛnyɔɔ bɛkɩ be be yela egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Gɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, nmɩ ma ɛnanɩ nyawɔ n sa dikwo-kɩlɩn daanɩ. Na wo ebi ɔya gɛtɛ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛ̀ sa dikwo fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Gɛtɛ na wo miinbi wʋʋ duwi-siyeefɛ fɔ, ɛwɔ mɔ e wo. Tɩɩ bɛnyɔɔ n sa dikwo fɔ daanɩ, ɛkɩ ɛn ma fɩya ma ɛtɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />&lt;&lt;Gɛ odente fɔ, ɛnanɩ nyawɔ wobi e ku, yema ɛ dʋrɔ wo koro. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ tɔ odente wuu getite, gɛ ɛ ka miinbi fɔ e ye maakʋn, ɔya gɛtɛ nmɩ, aasʋgʋgyan na fwa bʋda fɔ. Ɛ ka miinbi fɔ ɛ dʋrɔ wɔ bɩlan baanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka woyo ekulɛ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ mɩɩn bɩlan baanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Gɛtɛ na lama gagyɩgyan nan tɛ miinbi dɩnyʋn fɔ, na we gɛtɛ e ku. Mɔ gɛtɛ na nya wɔ gepepe fɔ, na we gɛtɛ nka miinbi gɛtɛ na wo fɔ wɔ lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Mɔ ɛna-do fɔ, alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa, ebi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa nkpa fɔ, è di miinyo, gɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ e ku fɔ è di gɛ aayo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Mɔ egyegeyelɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa, ebi gɛtɛ e ku fɔ, è di aayo, gɛ miinyo n si nkpa fɔ!&gt;&gt;Gɛ bɛ ka be gyu getiira egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwɔ nyawɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Miinbi n sa nkpa fɔ, gɛ aayo na ku fɔ,&gt; gɛ edo mɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Kpakpaakpa, aabi na ku, gɛ miinbi n sa nkpa fɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka tata ɩ tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛ ka tata bɛ mɔma egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yo ebi gɛtɛ è si nkpa fɔ ifèn ɩnyɔɔ, fɔ àà ka ofen wuukɩ tɛ ɛkɩ, fɔ àà ka ofen-do mɔ tɛ edo fɔ mɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Gɛ wʋ mɛ ɛna gɛtɛ wobi ɛ̀ sa nkpa fɔ gutunkoro, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Miinfonte, ka ebi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa nkpa fɔ tɛ wɔ, kara wolo wɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Mɔ ɛna edo fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ oo, awɔ oo, taanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan wura ebi fɔ. I yo wɔ akpen anyɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka ebi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa nkpa fɔ ɩ tɛ ɛna-gyangbasɛlɛ fɔ. Ɩ kara wolo wɔ, ɛwɔ n di wɔna.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu bɛ nʋn egyu-dɩrɛ gɔdɔ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ fɔ, bɛ ka gebù-dɩrɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ, yema be we gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ gɛsɛyɩ gɛ ɛ ka ɛ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ fɔ ma giisele.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon bɛndɩrɛbi ma bɔɔ bʋtʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Okoro Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e di bugyu Isareli powu. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Gɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba gebù-dɩrɛ fɔ baayere n di, Sadoki wobi Asariya gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ, ma <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Sisa wo bebi Eliyorefi, ma Ahiya n di bɛŋwaralɛ, gɛ Ahiludi wobi Yewosafati n di digbongbo dɩɩ gbɛrɛlɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Yohoyada wobi Benaya è di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ, gɛ Sadoki ma Abiyata bè di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Natan wobi Asariya è di bɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɔɔndɩrɛ, gɛ Natan wobi Sabudi n di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ma egyu-dɩrɛ wamɩnlɛ yɩɩtɛlɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahisa n tɛ nya egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsʋgʋgyan ma wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn wɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ boo koro, gɛ Abida wobi Adoniram n tɛ nya bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nyɩ bɛnɩ bàà mɛ gʋtʋn tɛ gɩfɩɩ fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Solomon mɔ ɛ sɩ̀ bɛndɩrɛ fwo-bɛnyɔɔ, gɛtɛ baà kpakya Isareli wɔ-ɩlanlan fɔ powu. Gɛ bɛɛ kʋla anyandilɛ bɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ ma wo digyu-kpaara. Ɛndɩrɛ-kamasɛ ɛɛ kʋla anyandilɛ ebon gɩkyan gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Baayere n di, Ben-Wuri gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya Efrayim wo-idon yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Ben-Dekeri gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya Makasi, ma Salabim, ma Beti-Semesi, ma Elon-Betanan atele yii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Ben-Hesedi ɛɛ nya Aruboti, fɩya ma Soko atele, ma atele powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gbɛma Hefe fɔ buu koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Ben-Abinadabi, gɛtɛ e to Solomon wobi Tafati gɩnan fɔ, ɛɛ nya Nafati-Dori gɩlan gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Ahiludi wobi Baana n tɛ nya Taanaki, ma Megido, ma Beti-Sana powu ka san Yaretan gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yesireli fɔ, ma Beti-Sena gɛtʋnkwaa ka san Abeli-Mehola, ka ma ye Yokimema ditele. <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Ben-Geberi n tɛ nya Ramoti-Gileyadi. Ɛwɔ na to Manase wobi Yari watele gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Gileyadi fɔ, ma Arigobi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Basan gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ ma waatele dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ akpilin asiyee gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin yɩ, gɛ bɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩpʋnʋ bɛ sa yɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ido wobi Ahinadabi n tɛ nya Mahanami. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimasa gɛtɛ e to Solomon wobi Basemati gɩna fɔ, n tɛ nya Nafitali gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Husayi wobi Baana n tɛ nya Ase, ma Aloti ntʋnkwaa buu koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Paruwa wobi Yewosafati n tɛ nya Isaka gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Ela wobi Simeyi n tɛ nya Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Wuri wobi Geberi n tɛ nya Gileyadi gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gì di Amori bete boogyu Sihon, ma Basan boogyu Ogi booyo fɔ. Ɛndɩrɛ kɩlɩn ɛtɔkɔ na kpakya Yuda wɔlanlan wʋtɔkɔ powu.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon bugyu bʋ san gepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Yuda bɛnɩ ma Isareli bete bɛ̀ sɔ anlɛ ɛpʋ-kere wɔ ɩŋɛrɛ. Be di ɔsɛ, be di, gɛ bɛ nyʋn. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Gɛ Solomon bugyu bʋ yɛrɛ bu ye Efurate getu, ka san Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ gɩlan, ka ma sere Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩbalan baanɩ. Gɛlɛ gɩɩ ntʋnkwaa bʋtɔkɔ bʋʋ bɛnɩ be le gɩkyan-gɩkyan gii gutoro bɛ tɛbɛ tɛ Solomon gɛ bɛ sara wɔ gatɩn wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Anyan-dilɛ kperen-kperen gɛtɛ Solomon ee hiyan ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka nya wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ boo koro duwi daanɩ fɔ n di ɔnʋmʋ-sʋnlɛ, gali bɛbagɩ akpilin asiyee ma kooron (66), ma ɔnʋmʋ tuntun bɛbagɩ akpilin kooron ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (132). <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />Ma bɛkwɔ ma ayo fwo, ma bɛkwɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɛban gaanɩ dikpilin, ma bɛyɛran akpilin ton, ma begbebi fɩya ma ɔtʋrʋn ɛbɛ, ma bɛpɩtɩrɩkyɛ, ma bɛlɛlʋn, ma getu gɩɩ bɛkpakpafwe-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Solomon bugyu bʋ yɛrɛ bʋ san Efurate wofila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan ye Tifisa ma sere Gasa, gɛ ɛ sara ma olila ma wɔ-ɩbalan fɔ powu yɩɩ bɛnɩ. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Gɛ Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa ma Isareli bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnɩ, ye Dan ka ma sere Beeseba powu, bɛ sara olila waanɩ Solomon wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ. Ɛkamasɛ e wura ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ wayɩn wo-ili, ma wo figi wo-iyon.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomon ɛ̀ ba abengyi-kwo ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ (4,000) tɛ wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ ɩgbaa kooron (12,000).<verse eid="1KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Gɛ ɔlanlan wʋʋ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ wobon anɩ, bɛɛ kʋla anyandilɛ bɛ bɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ma bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɔkpʋlɔ wʋʋpɩ fɔ. Bɛɛ ka gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ee lila fɔ bɛ mɔma wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛɛ ka afɩnaa, ma dɩfa-kɔlɛ bɛ bɛ tɛ tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi, gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔsa gepepe fɔ yɩɩ gɛdʋrɔkʋn.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ Solomon gɛsɛyɩ ma ade yaanɩ yɩɩ gɛnʋn, ma amɩnlɛ kpekpesi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sɔ anlɛ ɛpʋ wokere wʋʋ-ɩŋɛrɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Solomon gɛsɛyɩ fɔ, gɩ da bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ, ma Egyipiti bɛnɩ powu booyo. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Solomon ɛ sɛyɩ ɛ da ɛnɩ-kamasɛ, ɛ sɛyɩ ɛ da Esira-te Etan, ma Malo wo bebi Eman, ma Kalikoli, ma Darida. Gɛ wo diyere dɩ yasɩ dɩ san ande powu gɛtɛ i silin wɔ i tuma fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Solomon ɛ gbɛrɛ akpalɩ gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (3,000), gɛ ɛ nʋma ɩnʋn nkpɩn ton ma ton (1,005). <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ da ma iyon yii koro. Ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ da ma seda woyon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Lebanon, ma hisopu gɛtɛ wu ye ɔpɔrɩ wuu koro. Gɛ ɛ nɩ wùlà ade kadama bɛnan, ma bɛsɩsɩra, ma bɛnan-kpɩɩlɛ, ma bɛsʋ̀n boo koro. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Gɛ bɛnɩ be ye ande-ande yaanɩ bɛ bɛ nʋn Solomon gɛsɛyɩ gaade. Gɛ begyu-dɩrɛ kpekpesi bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ba Solomon wakʋn bɛ bɛ nʋn wɔ gɛsɛyɩ gaade fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ɛɛ pɩna koro èè sere dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Gɛtɛ Tire wogyu Hiram ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ bɛ sʋrʋ Solomon bʋnɔ be sere bugyu èè sere wote Dafidi gɩsɩrɩ fɔ, ɛ sa wɔ bɛsalɛ Solomon wakʋn, yema Hiram è di gɛ Dafidi wɔwɔlɔn-kanlɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Gɛ Solomon e birima ɔtʋn nyawʋ ɛ sa Hiram alan, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />&lt;&lt;À nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ miinte Dafidi ɛn talɩ sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ tɛ Yahwe wo Wurubwarɛ diyere, yema bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be silin wɔ be tuma gɛ bɛɛ kpà ma ɛwɔ fɔ wuu koro, ka ma sere gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sa Dafidi bɩsɩrɩ bʋʋ gatɩn. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Nkenkele Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ mɩ olila mɩɩ-ɩbalan fɔ powu yaanɩ, gɛ nn ma ɛkyʋnlɛ ɛkɩ, gɛ dɩyɩyɛ dɩkɩ dɩn taa tama mɩ. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Okoro na mɛ gɛtɛ nan sere dikwo-dɩrɛ Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ diyere dii koro. Anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ miinte Dafidi alan, &lt;Aabi gɛtɛ nan sere bugyu n sere aa gɩsɩrɩ fɔ, eè sere dikwo-dɩrɛ miin diyere daanɩ.&gt; fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />&lt;&lt;Okoro sa bɛnɩ Lebanon bàà ma kebi seda wo-iyon bɛ bɛ tɛ mɩ. Mɩɩn bɛnɩ baà mɛ gʋtʋn ma aa bɛnɩ, fɔ nan le aa bɛnɩ fɔ gutoro anlɛ gɛtɛ aà lila fɔ. Yema à nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ tɩn ma ɛnɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba adawʋ-kebilɛ iyon anlɛ aa bɛnɩ Sidon bete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Gɛtɛ Hiram ɛ nʋn Solomon wɔtʋn fɔ, wʋ mɛ wɔ ɔsɛ gɛ ɛ dɔ alan, &lt;&lt;N te sila Yahwe ǹdò, yema ɛ tɛ Dafidi ebi-sɛyɩlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ kpakya gɩfɩɩ-dɩrɛ nyagɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Okoro Hiram ɛ sa Solomon ɔtʋn alan,&lt;&lt;Na to aatʋn gɛtɛ a sa mɩ fɔ. Gɛ nan mɛ aa gelenbi ka dama seda ma sipiresi iyon fɔ yii koro ǹ tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Mɩɩn bɛnɩ baà ka yɩ be ye Lebanon wodon wuu koro bɛ waran bɛ ba Meditereniya wɔpʋ wɔpɩ. Fɔ bàà ban yɩ be bo anlɛ ɩkʋlɩ, bàà ka yɩ bɛ kààrà bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aà wùlà fɔ. Dʋkɔbɛ fɔ baà furu yɩ bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ aa bɛnɩ bàà ka yɩ mɔma wɔ̀. Gɩnyan gɛtɛ n te len àà mɛ tɛ mɩ fɔ n di gɛtɛ, àà ka anyandilɛ mɔma miin digyukpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ. <verse eid="1KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Okoro Hiram ɛ tɛ Solomon seda ma sipiresi iyon powu gɛtɛ è len. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Gɛ Solomon mɔ ɛ tɛ Hiram afɩnaa kotoku asepekyi anyɔɔ (44,000), fɩya ma bʋnɔ-kpara bɛgarawa disepekyi dɩkɩ ma gbaa (22,000). Solomon ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ mɛ gɛlɛ ɛ tɛ Hiram gɩkyan n di gɩkyan. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Yahwe ɛ tɛ Solomon gɛsɛyɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. Olila wʋ sara Hiram ma Solomon boo getite, gɛ ɛbɛ ma ɛwɔ bɛ tà dikola.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e tiira bɛnɩ disepekyi ma ɩgbaa ton (30,000) Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ powu ɛ sa dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />E yo bɛ akpen asiyee, gɛ ɛɛ sa baanɩ ɩgbaa ton (10,000) Lebanon e foma ebon-kamasɛ. Nyawʋ wuu wùlà alɛ dikpen-kamasɛ dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛɛ ma sara Lebanon ebon ɛkɩ, fɔ bɛ ma sara bɔɔlɛ bebon bɛnyɔɔ. Adoniram n tɛ nya boo koro. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomon ɛ̀ ba atola yii betolalɛ asepekyi asiyee ma ɩgbaa ton (70,000), ma ataa yɩɩ begbenalɛ asepekyi anaa (80,000) idon yaanɩ, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />fɩya ma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba gebù ɔgbaa wʋkɩ ma nkpɩn kooron, ma akpilin ton (3,300) gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛbi ma gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Egyu fɔ ɛ yɛ be gbena ataa-dɩrɛ ma ɔyɛkɛma, gɛtɛ bàà ka sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere-ɔpɩ. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Gɛ Solomon wadawʋ yɩɩ bɛsalɛ, ma Hiram woyo ɛbɛ, ma Gebali bete be gbena ataa, gɛ bɛ pɩna iyon ma ataa fɔ bɛ tɛ dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon e sere dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Isareli bete boo geye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ wʋʋ gɩkyan nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin anaafɛ (480) gaanɩ, gɛtɛ wù di Solomon wɔ gɩkyan naafɛ gaanɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ kpakya Isareli powu fɔ. Sifi gɛtɛ è di Isareli wobon nyɔɔfɛ fɔ wanɩ gɛ ɛ kya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e sere fɔ, daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anaa ma fwo (90), gɛ daayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30), gɛ daatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (45). <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Kpata fɔ waabo ì we kyɛkyɛ ma Dikwo fɔ daayɛrɛ. Waayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo ton (15), gɛ waabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Ɛ sa bɛfansɩrɩ dikwo fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ yaanɩ. Bɛfansɩrɩ fɔ bè we mɔmɔkyɩ okòro, gɛ bɛ ma yɛrɛ gamɩ. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Gɛ e biri e sere ɔpɔrɩ-dɩrɛ e silin Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ sa getite ma akwo yaabi powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa dɩɩ gamɩ fɔ. E sere abansʋrʋ ma waakwobi ɛ marama ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Abansʋrʋ fɔ gatɩn gaakwo fɔ yaabi yaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5). Getite gaakwo fɔ yaabi yaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ yɛkɩ (9), gɛ gatala gaakwo fɔ yaabi yaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo ma ɔfan (10.5). Gatɩn gɩɩ-ɩpɔrɔ fɔ yaayɛrɛ yii koro wun mɩnɩ hiyan gɛtɛ bàà sa iyon-larɩlɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere gaanɩ fɔ, gɛtɛ bɛ wɛrɛ pɩna ataa powu be ye yɩɩ gɛpɩnakʋn okoro, an nan nɩ̀ nʋn hama, abɛɛ dɩkyɔɔ abɛɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan abɛɛ anyan-kurumakyɛɛ yɩɩ gewula.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Otunu gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ san gatɩn gaakwo fɔ yaanɩ, wʋ̀ sa dikwo fɔ dɩɩ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan. Be tiri osele gɛtɛ wʋ bʋn san getite gaakwo fɔ yaanɩ ka ma ye gatala giiyo fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Okoro Dafidi e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ e were. Ɛ pɩna dɩ, gɛ ɛ ka seda wo-iyon yɩɩtaa ma ɩwanlalɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ dɩ. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Gɛ e sere akwo yaabi-gyagalɛ ɛ marama Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, gɛtɛ yaatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ bɛ ka seda iyon bɛ walɩ yɩ bɛ kyaga ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ gye yɩ bɛ marama ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />&lt;&lt;Dikwo gɛtɛ aa sere lɛ wuu koro, gengyi àà tɛrɛma maade-wùlàlɛ, ma maade tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ gɛ àà di mii-ise powu yii koro, gɛ àà bù mɩ fɔ, nan da ma aa koro n mɛ ade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ na sɩ̀ na tɛ aate Dafidi fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Gɛ nan sara Isareli bete baanɩ. Mɩn nan kere mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete n ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Okoro Solomon e sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ e were. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Gɛ ɛ tɛrɛ seda wo-iyon ɛ marama ɩpɔrɩ fɔ, ma gɛtʋnkwaa, ma gɛwalɩkʋn fɔ, ma dɩɩ gamɩ gɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ ye gatɩn ma sere gatala. Gɛ ɛ tɛrɛ oloko wuu-iyon ɛ walɩ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ mɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Gɛ ɛ ka seda wo-iyon e yo Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gama gɩɩ gɩlan ye gatɩn ma sere gatala gɛtɛ wàà mɛ dikwo-bi dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè dɩ Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ. Dikwobi fɔ daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Dikwo dii dibi gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ wʋʋ bʋnʋn fɔ waà mɛ anlɛ bɩsɩrɩ akpilin asiyee (60). <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Gɛ bɛ salɩ seda wo-iyon bɛ mɛ anlɛ akumani ma afwɛ bɛ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ ɔmɩrɩ. Seda wo-iyon gɛ ɛ ka ɛ marama ɔkʋn-kamasɛ, gɛtɛ an nan we ɔpɔrɩ wʋʋkankɩ.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Ɛ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ Dɩɩkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn, gɛtɛ bàà ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ wʋ gamɩ waabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30), gɛ waayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). Daatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). Gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara ɛ bɔlɩ dɩɩ gamɩ, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ bɛ ka seda wo-iyon bɛ mɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Solomon ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara ɛ bɔlɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya wagbarɩgbarɩ ɛ kyɔlɔga ma Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn wuutunu gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛ bɔlɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Okoro ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ powu, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ mɔ.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Solomon ɛ ka olife woyon ɛ salɩ Kerubi ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ, gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ watɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo ton (15) ɛ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ Dɩɩkʋn Dɩrɛkʋn daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kerubi fɔ ɛkɩ dɩbanba daabo dɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ ye dɩbanba dɩkɩ diinyun ma sere dɩbanba-nyɔɔfɛ diinyun fɔ, waabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo ton (15). <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Gɛ Kerubi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ mɔ waabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5). Baalɩ, ma boodu wù we kyɛkyɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Gɛ Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ ɛkamasɛ wabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo ton (15). <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Ɛ ka Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ Dikwo-dɩrɛ Dɩɩkʋn Dɩrɛkʋn fɔ daanɩ, ma baabanba gɛtɛ bɛ yɛrɛba fɔ. Fɔ Kerubi fɔ ɛkɩ dɩbanba dɩɩ kya ɔpɔrɩ wʋkɩ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ Kerubi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ mɔ wɔ dɩbanba dɩɩ kya ɔpɔrɩ-do mɔ. Gɛ baabanba ɩɩ kya bɔɔwɔlɔn dikwo fɔ dii getite. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Gɛ ɛ salɩ-salɩ Kerubi ɛbɛ ma iben-yon, ma afwɛ ɛ marama-marama Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ, gamɩ ma okòro powu. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ afwɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ɛ sa gamɩ ma okòro wakwo yaanɩ fɔ powu.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Gɛ ɛ ka olife woyon ɛ mɛ itunu-yon gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba igen ton ɛ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Gɛ ɛ salɩ Kerubi ɛbɛ ma iben-yon, ma afwɛ ɛ gyaga olife iyon yaatana anyɔɔ fɔ yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ ma iben-yon, ma afwɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛ ka olife woyon ɛ mɛ itunu-yon gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba igen ɩnaa ɛ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ gbagba diitunu. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Ɛ ka oloko ɛ mɛ ɩpʋnʋ ɩnyɔɔ gɛtɛ ɩɩ tan i tuma. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />E tiba sɩka-sɩya e tiri Kerubi ma iben-yon, ma afwɛ ɛ gyaga yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ yɩ.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Gɛ Solomon ɛ ka ataa akpen asiyee e sere ɩgba isiyee, ma seda wo-iyon-salɩlɛ ɔgba wʋkɩ e silin Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Solomon bugyu buu gedi gɩɩ gɩkyan-naafɛ gaanɩ, Sifi gɛtɛ è di Isareli wobon nyɔɔfɛ fɔ wanɩ gɛ ɛ kya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Gɩkyan fwo gɩkɩfɛ, Buli wobon, ebon nɩyɛfɛ anɩ gɛ be sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ma daanyan-manyan powu be were. Solomon ɛ ka gɛ bɩkyan kwarankɩ e sere di e werema.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon e sere wo digyukpaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomon mɔ e sere ɛwɔ gbagba dɩkpaara. Ɛ ka gɛ bɩkyan fwo bisiyee e sere wo digyu-kpaara fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />E sere akwo digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ sa dɩkɩ diyere alɛ Lebanon Gɩkan gii dikwo. Daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (150), gɛ daayɛrɛ dɩ̀ ba akpilin asiyee ma fwo ton (75), gɛ dɩɩ gɛtɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (45). Bɛ ka seda wo-iyon be sere bepila ɩgba ɩnaa. Ɔgba-kamasɛ wʋ̀ ba bepila fwo ton gɛtɛ seda woyon wʋkɩ wʋ̀ gyaga pila ɛkɩ wo koro. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Gɛ bɛ ka seda wo-iyonbi be tin ɩtaa gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ yii koro fɔ. Ɩ̀ ba bepila akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton, gɛ ɔgba-kamasɛ wʋ̀ ba bepila fwo-ton. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Gɛ be tiri nfansiri ɛbɛ gatala ɩgba isiyee. Nfansiri ɛbɛ fɔ ì ten ma bɔɔwɔlɔn akpen asiyee, ofèn ma ofèn. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Nfansiri ɛbɛ ma itunu-yon fɔ powu ɩ̀ ba igen ɩnaa, gɛtɛ yaabo ɩ da yaayɛrɛ. Gɛ nfansɩrɩ ɛbɛ fɔ ì ten ma bɛwɔlɔn ofèn ma ofèn ɩgba isiyee. <verse eid="1KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Gɛ e sere gɛsarakʋn gɛtɛ ɛ sa gɩ diyere alɛ bepila yii dikwo. Gaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin asiyee ma fwo-ton (75), gaayɛyɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (45). Gɛsarakʋn fɔ gɩ̀ ba kpata, gɛtɛ bɛ ka bepila be sere.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />E ni sere gigyu-biya gii dikwo gɛtɛ ee kpèlè dɩ alɛ Gɔdɔ-Kpara gii Dikwo, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɩ̀ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ. Okoro bɛ wanla seda wo-iyon bɛ marama dikwo fɔ dɩɩ gatɩn ma sere gɛwalɩkʋn. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Ɛwɔ gbagba dɩkpaara-saralɛ fɔ, dɩ̀ sa gɔdɔ gɩɩ gɛdɔ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ gama. Bɛ mɛ dɩ gɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ Gɔdɔ gii dikwo fɔ. Gɛ Solomon e sere dɩkpaara nyadɩ daakɩ ɛ tɛ Farawo wobi gɛtɛ e to gɩna fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Bɛ ka ataa-kpara, bɛ kɛrɛ yɩ, gɛ bɛ ka sɔya be kebi yɩ, gɛ bɛ kpalɩ yɩ bʋnʋn ma gama, gɛ bɛ ka yɩ be sere akwo fɔ, ye yɩɩ bɛkɔna baanɩ ma sere yii-igen yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Bɛ ka gɛ ataa-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ-kpara be sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere-ɔpɩ fɔ. Ataa fɔ ɩkɩ yaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo-ton (15), gɛ ido mɔ yaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo bʋnyɔɔ (12). <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Gɛ bɛ ka ataa-kpara, gɛ be kebi yɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ kʋtʋma, ma seda wo-iyon bɛ gyaga gesere-ɔpɩ fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Be sere-sere ataa ɩgba isiyee ma Seda wo-iyon ɔgba wʋkɩ be silin digyu-kpaara ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ dɩkpaara fɔ ma kpata fɔ powu.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ sa bɛ ma ka Huram, gɛtɛ e ye Tire fɔ bɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Wɔna è di gɛ ɛkpɩnsɔ gɛtɛ e ye Nafitali wofoli waanɩ. Gɛ wote è di Tire-te gɛtɛ è di gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩwɔrɔ fɔ. Huram ɛ̀ ba adawʋ gepepe, gɛ ɛ gya gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ gʋtʋn-kamasɛ gɩɩ gɛmɛ gaanɩ. Ɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wakʋn, gɛ ɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ powu.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Ɛ ka awɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ wɔrɔ bepila bɛnyɔɔ, gɛ pila-kamasɛ waatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma kwarankɩ (27), gɛ waalɩ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo nɩyɛ (18). Gɛ wʋʋfɩfɩ mɔ waà mɛ anlɛ gulobi. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Gɛ e biri ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ mɛ imini ɩkɩ anlɛ ayu ɛ gyaga gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gii bepila bɛnyɔɔ fɔ baayu yii koro. Gɛ wʋkamasɛ waabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5). <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Gɛ ɛ wɔrɔ agbarɩgbarɩ gɛtɛ ii gyu ma bɛwɔlɔn baanɩ kwarankɩ ɛ gyaga pila duyu-kamasɛ dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Gɛ ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ wɔrɔ anyankɩ anlɛ pomegraniti wabi, gɛ ɛ mɛ yɩ ɩgba ɩnyɔɔ ɛ kyaga ma bepila baayu fɔ. Ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ ke ɛ sa pila duyu-kamasɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Gɛ ɛ mɛ bepila gɛtɛ bè sere kpata wanɩ fɔ baayu yaanɩ anlɛ lili wafwe. Yaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kooron (6). <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Gɛ bepila bɔɔ-ɩgba ɩnyɔɔ fɔ powu yaayu yaanɩ fɔ, bɛ mɛ pomegraniti wabi gɛkpɩn (200) bɛ kyɔlɔga ma ayu fɔ be tuma. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Gɛ e sere bepila fɔ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ kpata waanɩ, gɛ ɛ sa pila gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ diyere alɛ Yakin, gɛ e kpèlè gatala giiyo fɔ mɔ alɛ Bosa. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Bepila fɔ bɔɔ gatala wù we anlɛ lili wafwɛ. Okoro e werema bepila bɔɔ gʋtʋn fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Huram ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ wɔrɔ butu buu geto-sakʋn-dɩrɛ kulu-kulu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ waayɛrɛ wʋ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo-ton (15), gɛ waatɔ wʋ̀ ba ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ wuu gesilin-tuma wʋ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (45). <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ e tiri anlɛ akumani yiinundu ɩgba ɩnyɔɔ butu bʋʋ geto-sakʋn fɔ wuunyun waanɩ. Ɛ gbɛrɛ akumani fwo ɛ sa gɩsɩrɩ gɩkɩ ma ɔfan-kamasɛ gaanɩ e silin butu bʋʋ geto-sakʋn wuunyun fɔ powu e tuma.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Gɛ butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ wʋ̀ gyaga bɛkwɔ-teni fwo-bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ boo koro. Besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten gatala gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten ofila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan. Butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ wʋ̀ gyaga boo koro, gɛ bɔɔ gama bɩsɩrɩ bʋʋ gɩlan fɔ powu ì ten ma bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Wuutin wʋ̀ ba gulobi-kɩlɩn gaabo. E mirigiti wuunyun anlɛ kɔpʋ wuunyun, abɛɛ anlɛ lili wafwɛ. Gɛ wuu to butu anlɛ garawa gbaa ɛkɩ (2,000).<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Gɛ e biri ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ wɔrɔ abʋn-yelakʋn fwo gɛtɛ aà talɩ a kpema-kpema yɩ. Wʋkamasɛ waabo, ma waayɛrɛ wʋ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kooron-kooron, gɛ wʋʋ gɛtɔ wʋ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ bɩnaa ma ɔfan. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ ayelakʋn fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ. Bɛ ka iyon-pansan-pansan bɛ marama abʋn-yelakʋn fɔ yɩɩ bɩlan baanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Bɛ mɛ bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀, ma bɛkwɔ-teni, ma Kerubim bɛ sa bɩlan fɔ baanɩ. Gɛlɛ ke bɛ mɛ afwɛ-lɔlɛ fɔ bɛ gyaga bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀, ma bɛkwɔ-teni fɔ bɔɔ gatala ma bɔɔ gatɩn. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Gɛ tunla-san-kamasɛ ɛ̀ ba gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ bɩsɩrɩ bɩnaa, gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan bɛ sa ma ɛyɩ anyɔɔ-anyɔɔ. Gɛ tunla-san-kamasɛ bɛkɔna baanɩ fɔ, bɛ mɛ imini-yelalɛ gɛtɛ tunla-san wɔ tasa fɔ ɛ̀ gyaga yii koro. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Bɛ mɛ difwe-kulu-kulu tunla-san fɔ getite gɛtɛ tasa gɛtɛ walun ɩ̀ ba gɩsɩrɩ gɩkɩ ma ɔfan (1.5) ɛ̀ taga waanɩ. Wuu difwe fɔ wù we kulu-kulu, gɛ wayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ bʋnyɔɔ ma geyo dɩnaa wʋʋ dɩkɩ. Gɛ bɛ salɩ anyan ma ɔmɩrɩ be silin difwe fɔ diinyun. Ayelakʋn fɔ ì we kyɛkyɛ yiifèn ɩnaa powu mɔ in we kulu-kulu. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Bɩsɩrɩ bɩnaa fɔ bʋ̀ sa imini-pansan-pansan fɔ yɩɩ gatɩn, gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan gɛtɛ bù de bɩsɩrɩ bʋnyɔɔ fɔ ɛ marama ma gɛbʋn-yelakʋn fɔ. Gɩsɩrɩ-kɩlɩn gɩɩ gɛtɔ gɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ bʋnyɔɔ ma geyo dɩnaa wʋʋ dɩkɩ. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Bɛ mɛ bɩsɩrɩ fɔ anlɛ tiiramisan bɩsɩrɩ. Bɛ ka gɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wù de bɩsɩrɩ fɔ ofèn ma ofèn fɔ, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka taya bɛ sa gaanɩ fɔ, ma gɩsɩrɩ gɩɩ bɩtà, ma dɩka dii gikunbi powu.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Bɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan-tonlɛ bɛ sa bɛkɔna bɛnaa fɔ baanɩ, gɛtɛ ɩ̀ marama ye tunla-san fɔ gatɩn bʋn ye. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Bɛ mɛ adawʋ yii mini ma ɔmɩrɩ kulu-kulu gɛtɛ waayɛrɛ yaà mɛ anlɛ gɩsɩrɩ gɩkɩ bɛ marama imini-pansan-pansan fɔ be silin tunla-san fɔ wayu yaanɩ. Awɔrɔnyan-tonlɛ-yelalɛ ma ɩpansan-pansan fɔ powu ɩ̀ kyaga ma tunla-san fɔ waayu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Ɛ mɛ Kerubi ɛbɛ, ma bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀, ma iben-yon ɛ marama awɔrɔnyan-tonlɛ fɔ, ma ayelakʋn fɔ ma ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ osele wʋ̀ sa fɔ, ma afwɛ ma ɔmɩrɩ e silin wʋ powu. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Anlɛ gɛ ɛ wɔrɔ ayelakʋn fwo fɔ. Ɛyɩ powu yaalɩ ma yiidu ì we kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Huram ɛ nɩ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ mɛ bɛtasa fwo, gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ ee to butu galon gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin ma fwo (230). Tunla-san-kamasɛ wayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kooron. Tasa-kamasɛ ɛ̀ gyaga geyelakʋn gɩkɩ gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Ɛ ka tunla-san ɛbɛ fɔ ton e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ ɛ ka ton kurumakyɛɛ fɔ e sere dɩɩ gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ ɛ ka tasa-dɩrɛ fɔ e sere Dikwo-Dɩrɛ fɔ diifila wʋ gɛtàkʋn ma gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan yii getite. <verse eid="1KI 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Huram ɛ nɩ wɔrɔ bɛtasa-dɩrɛ, ma bɛsɔfɩ, ma bɛtasabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Okoro Huram e werema gʋtʋn gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ wɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Ɛyɩ n di bepila bɛnyɔɔ fɔ, ma imini gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga baayu yii koro fɔ, ma imini gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kyaga ma bɛwɔlɔn gɛ ɩɩ sa bɛtasa bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ yii koro ɔmɩrɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />ma pomegraniti wabi nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400) gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kyaga ma ɩŋʋʋ ɩnyɔɔ gɛtɛ ɩɩ sa bɛtasa bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ yii koro gɛ bɛɛ sa bɛ ɔmɩrɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />ma ayelakʋn fwo ma yɩɩ bɛtasa fwo fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />ma butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ, ma bɛkwɔ-teni fwo-bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />ma isun, ma bɛsɔfɩ, ma bɛtasabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya-yalɩlɛ gɛ Huram ɛ ka ɛ mɛ anyan nyayɩ powu ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka anyan fɔ powu bɛ sa dɩtɩn-maralɛ daanɩ, Yodan wɔtalɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Sukoti ma Saretan boo getite fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomon ɛn kɛrɛ anyan fɔ, yema ɩ̀ sɔ gʋsɔ. Okoro bɛn nyɩnla gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya fɔ gɩɩdʋrʋ.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Gɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ powu. Ɛyɩ n di sɩka-sɩya gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, ma sɩka-sɩya wɔkpʋlɔ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka boroboro bɛ gyaga wuu koro bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />ma sɩka-sɩya-kpara bɛkandɩya bɔɔ gɛgyagakʋn. Bɛ ka yɩ ton-ton be sere ologyi ma dɩbɩyan pɛ àà gyu Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ, ma sɩka-sɩya wafwɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ, ma bɛkandɩya, ma ɔtan wʋʋ bɩnyanɩ, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />ma sɩka-sɩya bɛtasabi, ma omini-tiiralɛ kandɩya wayenkpen, ma bɛtasa, ma bɩtɩyɛ, ma olifwi wʋʋ tasa, ma sɩka-sɩya-kpara wɔ kʋlɔkʋlɔ tɛ gamɩ gii dikwo, Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ wʋʋpʋnʋ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii getumakʋn gɩɩpʋnʋ.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e werema Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn powu fɔ, ɛ ka anyan gɛtɛ wote Dafidi ɛ ka ɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ powu ɛ bɛ sa daanɩ. Ɛyɩ n di, sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan kperen-kperen fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ka Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e kpèlè Isareli bɛndɩrɛ, ma Isareli wo-ifoli yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ, ma Isareli wo-itunu yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ e tuma, gɛtɛ bàà ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ be ye Siyon, Dafidi Ditele bɛ ba Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Isareli bɛnɩ powu be be tuma egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wakʋn ɔsɛ wuu gedi wʋʋya waanɩ gɛtɛ wù di Isareli bete boobon kwarankɩfɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Etanim waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu be be gyu fɔ, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be kukuru Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ san Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete bɛ nɩ ka getuma gɩɩ Dɩyan dii dikwo fɔ, ma anyan fɩrɩnfɩrɩn-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu bɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon, ma Isareli bete powu gɛtɛ be tuma wakʋn Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn fɔ, be wolo bɛyɛran, ma bɛkwɔ-teni kpekpesi gɛtɛ an talɩ a kalan bɛ tɛ gedi.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Gɛ Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ma sɩ̀ dii gɛsarakʋn gamɩ, Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ Wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ sɩ̀ Kerubi ɛbɛ baa banban yɩɩ gatɩn. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ bɛ yɛrɛba baabanba be tin ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ dɔ fɔ, gɛ wu tin dɩ, ma dii-iyon-tonlɛ-tolalɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Iyon fɔ ɩ̀ ba abo, gɛtɛ gengyi à yela Ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn fɔ, gbɛma Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ, aà talɩ a we yɩ, mɔ gengyi à sa okòro fɔ, an nan we yɩ. Gɛ ɩ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ bè ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Gɩnyankɩ gɩn ma Dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ fɩya ma ataa-pansan-pansan anyɔɔ, gɛtɛ Mose ɛ ka ɛ sa daanɩ Horebi wodon wuu koro fɔ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ ta dikola ma Isareli bete ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Ɔya gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be ye Ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn fɔ, dɩkpaba di be tin Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛn talɩ mɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn dɩkpaba fɔ dii koro, yema Yahwe gingyebi gɩ yɔn ma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ ɛɛ̀ sara dɩkpaba-kpim daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Na sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ na tɛ wɔ̀, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aà sara gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu bè yela dʋkɔ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e fi bʋnʋn e ten bɛ, gɛ e hira bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà sila Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ dama wɔ gʋlɔ gii koro ɛ mɛ wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ miinte Dafidi fɔ. Ɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />&lt;Ye duwi gɛtɛ na tiri mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete na ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ lɛ, miin te tiri ditele dɩkɩ ye Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ yaanɩ gɛtɛ bàà sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ miin diyere dii koro bàà tɩ sʋma mɩ dʋkɔ. Mɔ na tiri Dafidi èè di bugyu tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />&lt;&lt;Miinte Dafidi ɛ ka ɛ sa woturu waanɩ gɛtɛ eè sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Mɔ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ miinte Dafidi alan, &lt;Gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa aaturu waanɩ alɛ aà sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ miin diyere dii koro lɛ, a mɛ ade gɛtɛ ade nyayɩ ɩ̀ sa aaturu waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Mɔ fɔ nka awɔ nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. Aabi gɛtɛ è di gɛ awɔ gbagba aa nkalan, ma aa koro-kpaba fɔ, nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ miin diyere dii koro.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />&lt;&lt;Yahwe e di wade-dɔ̀lɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro. Yema na sere miinte Dafidi bɩsɩrɩ, gɛ n si Isareli gigyu-bɩya gii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ, gɛ na sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ na tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ diyere dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Na mɛ gɛsarakʋn Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ na tɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka gɛtɛ ataa ɩ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ. Dɩdaka nyadɩ dii koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ tà dikola ma tiitu ɛbɛ ɔya gɛtɛ e tiri bɛ e ye Egyipiti fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ɛ tɔ e yela Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ bʋnʋn, Isareli bete fɔ powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ bʋma walɔ gatala, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, Oo Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, ɛkɩ ɛn ma gatala, abɛɛ gɛtʋnkwaa anlɛ awɔ. Awɔ gɛtɛ aa di gelen gii dikola gɛtɛ a tà ma aa bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka boo-ituru powu bɛ san aasele waanɩ fɔ dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />A di aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ miinte Dafidi gɛtɛ è di aasaranyan fɔ yii koro. A ka aanyun a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀, gɛ a dama aalɔ yii koro a yɛ wʋ ba waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ ǹdò lɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Nkele Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, di ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan, miinte Dafidi alan, &lt;Wʋn nan ba alɛ, an nan wura ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara Isareli gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro mɩɩn bʋnʋn, gengyi aa bebi baà bù mɩ gɛ baà di maade yii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ a mɛ fɔ.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Okoro nkele, oo Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, yɛ aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan miinte Dafidi fɔ, yàà ba waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />Gɛ gbagbaagba fɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ bɛ sara gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ? Gatala, ma gatala gɩɩ gatala gba ɩn nɩma wɔ̀ gɛsara, lan gɛ waà mɛ gɛ Dikwo gɛtɛ na sere lɛ daà nɩma wɔ̀? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Mɔ Oo Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan miinyun-tiri, fɔ àà we mɩ gutunkoro. Nʋn gewula ma onyun-tiri gɛtɛ aasaranyan ee tiri aa bʋnʋn ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Yɛ aa bʋnʋn bàà gyaga Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ dii koro odon ma ofilibo nfan nyawʋ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Miin diyere daà sara dʋkɔ.&gt; Fɔ àà wura nʋn onyun-tiri gɛtɛ nmɩ aasaranyan nte tiri nfan fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan maade-fɔlɛ, ma aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete booyo gengyi bè fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten nfan gɛ tì tiri onyun fɔ. Nʋn taakʋn ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ. Nʋn taakʋn, fɔ àà ka taade-kpen kyɛ tɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />&lt;&lt;Gɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ mɛ wɔwɔlɔn ade-kpen, gɛ wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kan ntam, gɛ ɛ̀ ba ɛɛ kan ntam aa gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ daanɩ nfan fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />nʋn ye gatala, fɔ àà mɛ wʋʋ gʋtʋn. Dɔ̀ aa bɛsaranyan fɔ bɔɔ gɔdɔ, fɔ àà tin ɛwɔ gɛtɛ waade ɩn kɔlɔ fɔ dɩpwɛ, fɔ àà ka wade-kpen tola wɔ. Fɔ àà tɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ wade ɩ̀ dɔ̀ fɔ aten.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bè di boo koro bɩtà baanɩ yema bɛ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen, gɛ bè biri bɛ ba aakʋn, be be kpèlè aa diyere be tiri onyun aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ̀ fɔ alɛ ka kyɛ bɛ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />nʋn bɔɔ gɛfɔ fɔ ye gatala, fɔ àà ka aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ, fɔ àà birima bɛ ba gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ boote ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi gatala gɩ̀ tan, gɛ ɛsʋn ɛn taa nʋ̀n, yema aa bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen aa koro, mɔ gengyi bɛ̀ dama dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro be tiri onyun, be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀ aa diyere daanɩ, yema aa tiira bɛ giten fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />nʋn baakʋn ye gatala, fɔ àà ka aa bɛsaranyan Isareli bete baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ. Wùlà bɛ dɩsarabi-kpara, fɔ àà yɛ ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a tɛ aa bɛnɩ gàà mɛ baadikurumanyan gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi dɩkpan abɛɛ gyerebi ɩ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro, abɛɛ anyandilɛ yɩɩ gɛmɩna abɛɛ bɛkpagyɩgyɩ, ma akpata, abɛɛ gengyi ɛkyʋnlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ bɛ sʋ bɛ ɛ sa boo ditele dɩkɩ daanɩ, abɛɛ gyerebi-dɩrɛ abɛɛ diyebabi gɛtɛ daà ba gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />gɛ gengyi aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ è nu koro, gɛ bɛ bʋma baalɔ be wùlà Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ be tiri onyun dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />nʋn ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ, fɔ àà ka baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ fɔ àà mɛ wʋʋ gʋtʋn, fɔ àà le ɛkamasɛ gutoro anlɛ gɛtɛ wade mɛlɛ ì we. Yema à nyɩ̀ woturu waanɩ gɛ awɔ aako n nyɩ̀ bɛnɩ powu boo-ituru yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Gɛlɛ fɔ, baà serenti wɔ̀ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ tiitu ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />&lt;&lt;Mɔ esela gɛtɛ en di aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete baanɩ ɛkɩ, mɔ gɛtɛ ɛ nʋn aa diyere-dɩrɛ, okoro e ye gende-fon gaanɩ ɛ ba, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />yema bɛnɩ baà nʋn aa diyere-dɩrɛ, ma aa gʋlɔ ma ɔkɛma, ma ade-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a mɛ a tɛ aa bɛnɩ, okoro gengyi ɛ̀ ba èè be tiri onyun aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />nʋn wakʋn ye gatala, aa gɛsarakʋn, fɔ àà mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ esela fɔ e lila wɔ̀ fɔ, fɔ wàà yɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bàà nyɩnla aa diyere, fɔ bàà serenti wɔ̀, anlɛ gɛtɛ aa mɛ a tɛ aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ, fɔ bàà nyɩnla alɛ dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na sere fɔ, àà diyere n gyaga dii koro.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi aa bɛnɩ bɛ̀ san bɩtà ma bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ, ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ à sa bɛ, gɛ bè fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a tiri, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na sere aa diyere dii koro, gɛ bè tiri onyun bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />nʋn boonyun-tiri ma bɔɔ gɛfɔ fɔ ye gatala, aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ, fɔ àà kpà tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />&lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ ɛn taà mɛ ade-kpen, okoro gengyi bɛ̀ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen, gɛ à ka owurufa boo koro, gɛ à tiri bɛ a tɛ bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bàà gye bɛ bɩtà, bàà ka bɛ san (ɛbɛ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ) bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ɔfɔ abɛɛ gbɛma, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />gɛ gengyi bè foma boo-ituru gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ be gye bɛ bɩtà bɛ san fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ bè fi bɛ ba aakʋn bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Tɩ mɛ ade-kpen, tɩ mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋn kɔlɔ, tɩ mɛ duyu-kɛma daade,&gt; <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />gɛ gengyi bɛ̀ ka boo-ituru ma bɔɔkala ɛbɛ powu be biri be foma bɛ ba aakʋn, bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be gye bɛ bɩtà fɔ bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ dʋkɔ fɔ, gɛ bè fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ bootu ɛbɛ, ma ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a tiri, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ na sere gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ̀ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ bè tiri onyun fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />nʋn boonyun-tiri ma bɔɔ gɛfɔ ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ àà kpaa bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Fɔ àà ka aa bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen fɔ baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ, ka boo giten-kɛma gaade kyɛ bɛ, fɔ àà yɛ bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bàà we bɛ gutunkoro. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Yema bè di gɛ aa bɛnɩ, aanyan yii bedilɛ gɛtɛ a tiri a ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ma dɩfana-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />&lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe! wura duwe-lila tɛ nmɩ aasaranyan ma aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete, fɔ àà tɩ̀ nʋn baakʋn ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bee wula be kpèlè wɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Yema a kyɔlɔ booko a ye ntʋnkwaa nyabʋ powu baanɩ, gɛtɛ bàà mɛ aa bɛnɩ-dilɛ anyan. Anlɛ gɛtɛ a dama aa saranyan Mose wo koro a dɔ̀ ɔya gɛtɛ awɔ, Yahwe-kpatakpɩrɩ a tiri tiitu ɛbɛ a ye Egyipiti fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Gɛtɛ Solomon e tiri onyun gɛ ɛ fɔ Yahwe e were powu fɔ, ɛ tɔ e ye Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ bʋnʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ e kura gɛ ɛ bʋma walɔ e wula gatala fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />E yela, gɛ ɛ ka gɩta-dɩrɛ e hira Isareli bete powu gɛtɛ be tuma dʋkɔ fɔ alan,<verse eid="1KI 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />&lt;&lt;I sila Yahwe, gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete getuna, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. Digyebi-kɩlɩn gba din ye ade-kpara powu gɛtɛ ɛ dama wɔsaranyan Mose wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ ɛ sara ma ɛtɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sara ma tiitu ɛbɛ fɔ, ɛ kara kere tɩ ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ kara tiri bʋnʋn ɛ ya tɩ. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />E fi tiituru e ba wakʋn, fɔ tàà san wo-isele yaanɩ, fɔ tàà di wo-ise, ma wade-wùlàlɛ, ma wade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ tiitu ɛbɛ fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Yahwe ɛ nʋn miinyun-tiri gɛtɛ na tiri fɔ odon ma ofilibo, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋn nmɩ wɔsaranyan, ma wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete boo duwi-kamasɛ daade-lilalɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Fɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bàà nyɩnla alɛ, Yahwe n di Wurubwarɛ, gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn ma wɔ gama. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Mɔ wù di gɛtɛ yàà ka yii-ituru powu ɩ tɛ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ, fɔ yàà di wade-wùlàlɛ ma wo-ise yii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ ì de waanɩ ǹdò lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii getiri okòro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ma Isareli bete powu, bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Solomon ɛ tɛ Yahwe olila wuu gedi. Ɛ ka bɛkwɔ-teni disepekyi ma gbaa (22,000), ma bɛyɛran ma begbebi asepekyi kooron (120,000) ɛ tɛ gedi. Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ma Isareli bete powu be tiri Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ okòro.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ mɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ dɩkpaara-titelɛ fɔ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yahwe dikwo fɔ dii bunun fɔ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn, gɛ ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, ma anyan yaabi yii gedi ma olila wuu gedi gaayo, yema gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ gì we pɩɩ gɛtɛ gàà talɩ to gekuma gii gedi, ma anyan yaabi yii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi gaayo fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Okoro Solomon ma Isareli bete powu be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ. Bɛnɩ bè lu ye Lebo-Hamati ka ma sere Egyipiti gifobi. Be di wʋ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn awi kwarankɩ, gɛ be biri bɛ fɩya awi kwarankɩ, gɛtɛ ɛwʋ powu wʋ mɛ awi fwo anaa. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Duwi-nɩyɛfɛ daanɩ fɔ, e tiri bɛ osele. Be hira egyu-dɩrɛ gɛ be biri bɛ da bɔɔ-ɩlɛ ɔsɛ waanɩ, yema ade-kpara gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ wɔsaranyan Dafidi ma Isareli bɛnɩ powu fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Gɛtɛ Solomon e sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyukpaara fɔ, ma anyan powu gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ fɔ e were fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà wɔ dɩnyɔɔfɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ e ti tiri koro e wùlà wɔ Gibeyon fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nʋn aanyun-tiri, ma aa gɛfɔ gɛtɛ a fɔ mɩ fɔ. Na mɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ gɛtɛ a sere bàà tɩ̀ sʋma mɩ daanɩ gakpaakpa lɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Mɩɩn bʋnʋn ma miinturu yaà gyaga dii koro ɔya-kamasɛ.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, gengyi à tɛrɛma mɩ nʋnkwarɩ anɩ, gɛ aade ɩ̀ tʋna anlɛ gɛtɛ aate Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ à mɛ ade powu gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ wɔ̀, gɛ aa di maade-wùlàlɛ, ma mii-ise yii koro fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />nan yɛ aa gigyu-bɩya gàà sere Isareli anɩ gakpaakpa anlɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ na sɩ̀ aate Dafidi alan, &lt;Ɔya wʋkɩ wʋn nan ba gɛtɛ nka aadu waanɩ wuu bebi nan di bugyu Isareli&gt; fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Mɔ gengyi ɛyɩ ma yii bebi ì kere mɩɩn gɛsʋma ɩ ya, gɛ in di mii-ise, ma maade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ na tɛ yɩ fɔ yii koro, gɛ ɩ̀ san ɩ ma sʋma bekpen fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />nan kpa Isareli n ye gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛtɛ na tɛ bɛ fɔ gaanɩ gɛ nan terema Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn miin diyere dii koro fɔ. Gɛ bɛnɩ powu baà tɩ ka Isareli be di giforo, fɔ bàà sa wɔ dɩkpàtà. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Dikwo nyadɩ daà biligi Dikwo-gbenalɛ. Gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ bɛ dama dɩɩpɩ fɔ, ɔmɩrɩ waà ku wɔ gɛ ɛɛ̀ yɩyɛ eè lila alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ ade nyayɩ ɩ ba gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ yii koro?&gt; <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Fɔ bɛnɩ baà tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;Yema be terema Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ e tiri bootu ɛbɛ e ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ bekpen bɔɔ gɛsʋma. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ gyerebi-dɩrɛ nyawɔ ɛ ba boo koro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon bʋtʋn gɛtɛ bʋ̀ nɩ fɩya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Solomon ɛ ka gɛ bɩkyan dikpilin e sere akpaara anyɔɔ fɔ e were, Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyu-kpaara fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ Tiro wogyu Hiram atele dikpilin Galilee gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, yema Hiram ɛ tɛ wɔ seda iyon, ma oloko, ma sɩka-sɩya powu gɛtɛ e hiya fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Hiram e ye Tiro ɛ ma nya atele gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ, wʋn di wɔ gʋnʋn. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e lila Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Miinnobi, atele mɔmɔ n di nyayɩ gɛtɛ a tɛ mɩ lɛ?&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛ sa atele fɔ diyere alɛ Kabuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabuli wuu wùlà alɛ atele gɛtɛ ɩn ma tɔnɔ</char></note> gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ diyere fɔ dɩ wɔ be ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Fɔ sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ Hiram ɛ ka ɛ tɩyɛma Solomon fɔ waà mɛ anlɛ siminti bɛbagɩ akpilin anaa ma fwo wʋʋdʋrʋ.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Dɩkpankpasan daanɩ gɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ mɛ bɛ ka be sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma wo digyukpaara, ma kpata gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Dafidi ditele dɩɩ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ, ma dɩkpaara fɔ powu, ma Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ, ma Hasori, ma Megido ditele, ma Gese ditele. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />(Fɔ Egyipiti wogyu Farawo ɛ tà bɩtà ma Gese ditele gɛ e gye dɩ bɩtà, gɛ ɛ sa dɩ ɔtan, e wolo Kanaan bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Gese ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ ka dɩ ɛ kyɛ wobi-nanɩbi gɛtɛ è di Solomon wɔsɔ fɔ anlɛ gɩnyan-kyɛlɛ ɛsanfɔn. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e biri ɛ sere Gese ditele.) E biri ɛ pɩna e sere Gatala gɩɩ Beti-Horon ma Gɩlan Beti-Horon, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />ma Baalati, ma Tadimo gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yuda wotonkuma waanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />ma atele powu gɛtɛ bɛɛ pɩna anyandilɛ bɛ sɩ̀ fɔ, ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma baabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ, ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Solomon ee len èè sere Yerusalem ditele daanɩ fɔ, ma Lebanon, ma gɛtʋnkwaa powu gɛtɛ ee di bugyu gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Bɛnɩ bɛkɩ be gyegeye bɛ sara Kanaan gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ pɛgɛ Isareli bete bɛ bɛ ba. Ɛbɛ n di Amori bete, ma Hiti bete, ma Perisi bete, ma Hiwi bete, ma Yebusi bete. Gɛlɛ gɩɩ bɛnɩ nyabɛ ben di Isareli bete, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />bè di gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Isareli bete ben wolo, gɛ bè kuruma fɔ boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ. Ɛbɛ gɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ bɛ bɛdɩ̀, gɛ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn ma ɔkɛma anlɛ gɛtɛ wù we be ye ma ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Mɔ Solomon ɛn ka Isareli bete fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ mɛ ɛdɩ. Ɛbɛ n di wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma begyegeyelɛ, ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ, ma wabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Ɛbɛ ke n di bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya Solomon gʋtʋn, ma gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ powu boo koro. Bɛ ba nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (550).<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Gɛtɛ Farawo wobi-nanɩbi fɔ ɛ karama e ye Dafidi Ditele daanɩ ɛ san digyukpaara gɛtɛ Solomon e sere ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, e sere okòro wʋʋ kpata fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Gɩkyan-kamasɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Solomon ɛɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi disere disiyee, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ e sere ɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ gii koro. Ee kuma olifwi mɔ, Yahwe bʋnʋn. Okoro Solomon e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ e were.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ nɩ mɛ ɩkʋlɩ-dɩrɛ kpekpesi Esiyon-Gebe, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Elati, Ɛpʋ-sɩya wokere, Edom gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hiram ɛ sa wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ nyɩ̀ ɛpʋ ade yaanɩ fɔ, alɛ bɛ ma mɛ gʋtʋn ma Solomon bɛnɩ. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Bɛ ka ɩkʋlɩ bɛ san Ofiri, gɛ be biri bɛ ba ma sɩka-sɩya bekotoku nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma dikpilin (420) bɛ bɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Seba wogyu-nanɩ e be silin Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ ɛ nʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Solomon diyere di ye ma ɛwʋ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ɛ sa Yahwe gingyebi fɔ, ɛ ba èè be ten wɔ onyun ma ade-lilalɛ ma ɔkɛma ɩkɩ. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Ɛ ba Yerusalem ma wɔ bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan, ma akpɔŋɔ, gɛtɛ ì tola anyan ma ofen, ma sɩka-sɩya gepepe, ma ataa ma ɔyɛkɛma, gɛ e be gyu Solomon wakʋn. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Solomon ade powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa wamɩnlɛ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e tiri wade fɔ powu yiinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ. Ade ɩkɩ ɩn mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɔkɛma gɛtɛ èè tiri yiinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ e we gɛsɛyɩ powu gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ̀ ba, ma Digyu-kpara gɛtɛ e sere, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />ma anyandilɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga wɔkpʋlɔ wuu koro, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi anlɛ gɛtɛ bè si, ma wɔ bɛsaranyan ma bɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa bɔɔ ngba, ma wɔ bʋkan bʋʋ bɛyaranlɛ, ma gekuma gii gedi gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɔmɩrɩ wu ku wɔ wʋ kààrà.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ na nʋn mɩɩn gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ ka dama aa gʋtʋn gɛtɛ a mɛ, ma aa gɛsɛyɩ fɔ, wʋ̀ sa waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Mɔ min to ade fɔ di bè ye ma ɔkʋna gɛtɛ nmɩ gbagba na ka mɩɩn gʋnʋn na be we. Nkyɛ bɛn dɔ̀ mɩ ade fɔ yɩɩfan gba. Aa gɛsɛyɩ, ma koro gaanyan powu gɛtɛ à ba fɔ, wʋ kààrà ade gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Aa bɛnɩ bɛ ma duyu-kpara! Gɛlɛ ke gɛ aa bɛndɩrɛbi, gɛtɛ bɛɛ nʋn aa gɛsɛyɩ gaade ɔya-kamasɛ fɔ, bɛ ma duyu-kpara! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Gesila gì di gɛ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ee len aade, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ̀ ɛ mɛ Isareli wogyu fɔ woyo. Yema gelen gakpaakpa gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ ba tɛ Isareli fɔ wuu koro gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ̀ bugyu, fɔ àà dɔ̀ gɔdɔ kyɛkyɛ ma giisele waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ bekilo ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin-ton (4,500), ma anyan ma ofèn kpekpesi, ma ataa gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔyɛkɛma. Solomon en wura anyan ma ofèn yàà nɩma anlɛ gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ nya.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Hiram wɔ-ɩkʋlɩ-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɩ tɩ ka sɩka-sɩya i ye Ofiri ɩ mɔma wɔ fɔ, ɩ ka alimugi wo-iyon ma ataa ma ɔyɛ-kɛma yaatola-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ mɔ ɩ ba. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka alimugi wo-iyon fɔ e sere bepila e gye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyu-kpaara fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka ɩkɩ ɛ mɛ adʋlɛ ɛbɛ ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ. Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ bɛn mɩnɩ mɔma alimugi wo-iyon asɔ yaanɩ gɛlɛ, abɛɛ bàà we ɩkɩ asɔ yaanɩ gɛlɛ nya be sere ma ǹdò.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len abɛɛ e lila fɔ, ka fɩya ma anyan gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ e ye agyu-nyan gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ-nyɩmalɛ fɔ be biri bɛ da bɔɔ gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon gɩkyɩnyɩn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ Solomon ee wura gɩkyan-kamasɛ fɔ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba siminti bɛbagɩ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin ton (500) wʋʋdʋrʋ, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />gɛtɛ bɛn kalan kɔba gɛtɛ ee to e ye gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ, ma Arabiya begyu-dɩrɛ powu, ma Isareli bete bɔɔ bɛnyalɛ fɔ baakʋn.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya be tiba bɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro gɛkpɩn (200). Bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya kilo besiyee ma ɔfan (3.5) bɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro-kamasɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />E biri e tiba sɩka-sɩya ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro-tɩtɩɩ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton (300). Ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya kilo ma ɔfan ɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro-kamasɛ. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ ma sɩ̀ Digyu-kpara gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Lebanon gɩkan fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ salɩ gigyu-bɩya gɛ ɛ ka etola anya ɛ sa gɩ adawʋ. Ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara ɛ bɔlɩ gɩ. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Gigyu-bɩya fɔ gɩ̀ ba akyikya-bʋnkʋn kooron, gɛ gɩɩ gama wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ, gɩ̀ ba gɛkpasakʋn kulu-kulu. Gɛ gɛbɩya fɔ gɩ̀ ba alɔ yɩɩ gɛgyagakʋn, giifen ɩnyɔɔ fɔ powu. Bɛ mɛ bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ bɛnyɔɔ be yela gɛbɩya fɔ gɩɩ dɩbɩyan ma giilogyi. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fwo-bɛnyɔɔ bè yela akyikya-bʋnkʋn kooron yii koro. Ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ ɛkɩ-ɛkɩ è yela gekyikya-bʋnkʋn-kamasɛ giifèn ma ofèn. Bɛn tɛ mɛ gigyu-bɩya nyagɩ gaakɩ anlɛ nyagɩ giidu tɛ bugyu bʋkɩ bɛ nya. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Bɛ ka gɛ sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon bɛkɔpʋ powu. Gɛ digyukpaara gɛtɛ bee kpèle Lebanon gɩkan fɔ daanɩ daanyan powu ì di gɛ sɩka-sɩya-kpara gɛ bɛ ka bɛ mɛ yɩ. Gɩnyankɩ gɩn ma gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɛ sɩka-fututu mɛ gɩ, yema Solomon wɔya waanɩ fɔ, sɩka-fututu ɛn ma gɩyɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ ba gɩyɛ gɩɩ-ɩkʋlɩ-kpekpesi ɛpʋ wo koro, fɩya ma Hiram woyo ɩkʋlɩ fɔ. Bɩkyan bisiyee-kamasɛ fɔ, ɩkʋlɩ fɔ ii ye Tarisisi ɩ ba ma sɩka-sɩya, ma sɩka-fututu, ma ditola-nyaa, ma bɛsɩsɩra, ma betema.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon gɛsɛyɩ ma wo koro gaanyan gɛtɛ e wura fɔ, ɩ da gɛtʋnkwaa giigyu-kamasɛ woyo. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ande powu yɩɩ bɛnɩ bee len gɛtɛ bàà bɛ nʋn Solomon gɛsɛyɩ gaade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Gɩkyan n di gɩkyan, ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba wakʋn fɔ, ɛɛ bɛ kyɛ wɔ sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya anyan, ma ngba-serelɛ, ma akpanyan, ma anyan ma ofèn, ma abengyi, ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Solomon e kʋla tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma abengyi, ma yii bɛgyagalɛ, gɛ e wura tiiramisan ɛbɛ nkpɩn kwarankɩ (1,400), ma abengyi ɩgbaa kooron (12,000), gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ma sɩ tiiramisan yaatele yaanɩ ma ɛwɔ egyu-dɩrɛ gbagba wakʋn Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ sɩka-fututu e gbintin Yerusalem anlɛ ataa tun-tun, gɛ seda wo-iyon i gbigi anlɛ gɛtɛ Sikamo wo-iyon ɩ yɔn odon wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Bɛ ka gɛ Solomon wabengyi fɔ be ye gɛ Egyipiti, ma Kuwe ntʋnkwaa baanɩ. Wɔ gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ fɔ be se yɩ be ye gɛ Kuwe. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Be se tiiramisan-kɩlɩn sɩka-fututu abi nkpɩn bisiyee (600), gɛ be se dibengyi kɩlɩn mɔ sɩka-fututu abi akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (150) be ye Egyipiti. Gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be fu yɩ bɛ tɛ Hiti bete ma Aram bete boo begyu powu.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ɛ nʋ̀n Wurubwarɛ wo-ise yii koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e to bendeni-na gɩna kpekpesi. Farawo wobi-nanɩbi fɔ gama fɔ, e to bɛnanɩ e ye Moba bete, ma Amon bete, ma Edom bete, ma Sidon bete, ma Hiti bete baanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Be ye gɛ bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bete alan,&lt;&lt;Ɩ kara to bɔɔ bɛnanɩ gɩna, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ bɛ kara to yii bebi gɩna, yema baà fi yɩɩ bʋnʋn be ye maakʋn yàà ma sʋma boo bekpen&gt;&gt; fɔ baanɩ. Mɔ gɛlɛ gɩɩ bɛnanɩ bɛtɔkɔ gɛ Solomon ɛ kpa ɛ marama gɛ e len baade. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />E to bɛna nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin ton (700) gɛtɛ bè di egyu-wɔsɔ ɛbɛ, ma bedima gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton (300), gɛ wɔsɔ ɛbɛ fɔ bɛ yɛ wɔ e kere Yahwe wosele ɛ ya. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ dan ditenikwaa fɔ, wɔsɔ ɛbɛ fɔ be fi wɔ bʋnʋn bɛ san bekpen baakʋn, gɛ ɛn mɩnɩ ka woturu powu tɛrɛma Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Ɛ sʋma Sidon bete bookpen Asitoreti, ma Amon bete bookpen-kpen Moleki. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Okoro Solomon e mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛn ka woturu powu tɛrɛma Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Solomon e sere dikpen-kwo ɛ tɛ Moba wokpen-kpen Kemosi, ma Amon bete bookpen-kpen Moleki, odon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yerusalem wofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ wo bendeni-sɔ fɔ powu, gɛtɛ be kuma olifwi, bɛ tɛ boo bekpen fɔ gedi.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ ka owurufa Solomon wo koro, yema woturu wu fi wu ye Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ e tiri koro e wùlà wɔ disere dɩnyɔɔ fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋ Solomon bekpen bɔɔ gɛsʋma gba fɔ, en di Yahwe wose fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ an di miin dikola, ma maade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ wɔ̀ fɔ yii koro okoro, nan nyɩ̀ n to bugyu fɔ n ye aa aakʋn, nan ka n tɛ aa bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Mɔ aate Dafidi wo koro, mɩn nan mɛ ade nyayɩ aa nkpa waawi yaanɩ, mɔ nan to bu n ye aabi wakʋn. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Mɔ mɩn nan to bugyu fɔ powu. Mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi ma Yerusalem gɛtɛ na tiri na sɩ̀ fɔ wuu koro, nan kere ofoli wʋkɩ n ya n tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon bɛkyʋnlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe ɛ yɛ Edom-te Hadadi ɛ mɛ Solomon wokengbelilɛ. E ye gɛ Edom digyukpaara daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Fɔ ɔya wʋkɩ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ kpà, gɛ e di Edom bete boo koro fɔ, gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Yowabi ɛ san ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma lò bekpena fɔ, e wolo beteni powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Edom ditele daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yowabi ma Isareli bete powu bɛ sara Edom ditele daanɩ bebon kooron ka ma sere gɛtɛ e wolo beteni powu Edom ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Mɔ Hadadi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sangba è di ebi fɔ, ɛ fɩya ma Edom bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma wote bɛ nya fɔ, gɛ be serenti bɛ da Egyipiti. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Bɛ tɔ be ye Midiyan, gɛ bɛ san Paran. Gɛ bɛ ka Paran beteni bɛkɩ bɛ fɩya ma koro bɛ san Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ Farawo wakʋn. Ɛ tɛ Hadadi dɩkpaara, ma gɛtʋnkwaa, ma anyandilɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Fɔ Hadadi wade i di Farawo gʋnʋn, okoro ɛ ka ɛwɔ gbagba wɔsɔ, egyu-nanɩ Tapenesi wonobi ɛ tɛ wɔ gɩna. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Gɛ Tapenesi wonobi fɔ e wo ebi-teni ɛ tɛ Hadadi, gɛ bɛ sa wɔ diyere alɛ Genubati. Gɛ Tapenesi ɛ kyala Genubati Farawo digyukpaara daanɩ. Gɛ Genubati ɛ sara ma Farawo bebi-teni dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Gɛtɛ Hadadi ɛ̀ sa Egyipiti fɔ, ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ Yowabi be ku. Ɛwʋ gɛ Hadadi ɛ dɔ̀ Farawo alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri mɩ osele, yɛ mɩ nan san mɩɩn gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Mɔ Farawo e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len àà biri san aa gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ? Gɩnyankɩ gii hiyan wɔ̀ gɛ mɩn mɛ tɛ wɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa! Mɔ awɔ yɛ mɩ nan san!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ Eliyada wobi Reson mɔ ɛ mɛ Solomon wokengbelilɛ. Ɛwɔ na serenti e ye wofonte Hadadese gɛtɛ è di Soba wogyu wakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Dafidi e di Soba wo koro fɔ, Reson e kʋla bɛnɩ gɛ bɛ tɔ be yela Dafidi wo koro gɛ Reson ɛ mɛ boogyegeyelɛ. Bɛ tɔ bɛ san bɛ ma sara Damasiko gɛ be to dʋkɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Reson ɛ mɛ Isareli bete bɔɔkyʋnlɛ Solomon wɔ nkpa waawi powu yaanɩ, ka fɩya ma Hadadi wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ. Reson e di bugyu Aram gɛ ɛ kyʋn Isareli ɛ kààrà.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobwam ɛ tɔ e yela Solomon wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Nebati wobi Yerobwam mɔ ke ɛ tɔ e yela egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wo koro. Fɔ è di gɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ è di Efrayim-te, gɛ e ye Sereda. Wɔna è di ɛkpɩnsɔ gɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Seruwa.<verse eid="1KI 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Ade gɛtɛ ɩ yɛ gɛ Nebati ɛ tɔ e yela egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wo koro fɔ n di gɛtɛ, ɔya gɛtɛ Solomon ɛɛ pɩna e sere kpata gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Dafidi ditele dɩɩ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ, ma wote Dafidi ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yerobwam è di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ è yela kin-kin. Gɛ gɛtɛ Solomon e we ɛsaranyanbi nyawɔ waniya yɩɩ gɛsa fɔ, e tiri wɔ e yela gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya Yosefu dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɔɔ dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn gii koro. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Duwi dɩkɩ fɔ, Yerobwam e ye Yerusalem ditele daanɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ ɔkankɩ fɔ, e tuma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ahiya gɛtɛ e ye Silo fɔ osele waanɩ. Fɔ Ahiya ɛ̀ sa gɛgba-fon-serelɛ, gɛ bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ booko n sa dɩfa daanɩ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ahiya e gye wɔ gɛgba-fon-serelɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ fɛɛran gɩ akpen fwo-anyɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Yerobwam alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri akpen fwo! Yema Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nya, anlɛ gɛ nan lanla bugyu fɔ n ye Solomon gʋlɔ, fɔ nan ka ifoli fwo n tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Mɔ mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi, ma Yerusalem ditele gɛtɛ na tiri na ye Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ powu yaanɩ okoro, eè wura ofoli-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Nan mɛ ade nyayɩ, yema be terema mɩ, gɛ bɛ sʋma Sidon wokpen Asitoreti, ma Moba bete bookpen Kemosi, ma Amon bete bookpen Moleki, gɛ bɛn san mii-isele yaanɩ, gɛ bɛn mɛ ade-tʋnalɛ mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ ben di maade, ma mii-ise yii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ Solomon wote Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Mɔ mɩɩn nan to bugyu fɔ powu n ye Solomon gʋlɔ. Mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi, gɛtɛ na tiri, gɛ e di maade ma mii-ise yii koro fɔ wo koro, nan yɛ èè di bugyu wɔ nkpa waawi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Mɔ nan to bugyu fɔ n ye wobi gʋlɔ, fɔ nan ka ifoli fwo fɔ yii bugyu n tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Nan ka ofoli fɔ wʋkɩ n tɛ wobi, fɔ mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi wodu wàà wura sara Yerusalem, ɔya-kamasɛ ditele gɛtɛ na ka miin diyere na gyaga dii koro fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, nan ka wɔ̀ àà mɛ egyu fɔ àà di bugyu ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aaturu wuu len, fɔ àà mɛ Isareli wogyu. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Gengyi à mɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ n dɔ̀ wɔ̀, gɛ àà san mii-isele yaanɩ, gɛ à mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ à di maade, ma mii-ise yii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ, nan fɩya ma awɔ, gɛ nan yɛ aa bugyu buu gedi baà sara gakpaakpa, anlɛ gɛtɛ na sere Dafidi woyo fɔ, gɛ nan ka Isareli n tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Solomon wade-kpen fɔ yii koro, nan warama Dafidi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ gatɩn, mɔ nka gakpaakpa. <verse eid="1KI 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Solomon e len èè wolo Yerobwam, mɔ Yerobwam e serenti ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ Sisaki wakʋn Egyipiti, gɛ ɛ sara dʋkɔ ma sere gɛtɛ Solomon e ku.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Gɛ Solomon bugyu baade, ma ade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ powu, ma wɔ gɛsɛyɩ gɛtɛ e tiri e wùlà fɔ powu fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Solomon wakpa yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomon e di bugyu Yerusalem ma Isareli powu bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ (40). <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ wote Dafidi Ditele daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Rehobwam e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Isareli ɛ tɔ e yela Rehobwam wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Rehobwam ɛ tɔ ɛ san Sekem ditele daanɩ, yema Isareli bete powu bɛ san dʋkɔ, bàà ma sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Gɛtɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, e biri e ye Egyipiti ɛ ba. Waanɩ fɔ ɛ̀ sangba ɛ̀ sa Egyipiti, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ e serenti e ye egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wakʋn ɛ san fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Okoro bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma kpèlè Yerobwam, gɛ ɛwɔ ma Isareli bɛnɩ powu, bɛ san Rehobwam wakʋn, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Aate ɛ ka ditola ma ɔdʋrʋ ɛ kyɔlɔga tɩ gigyen, mɔ nkele awɔ tɩyɛra dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn, ma ditola ma ɔdʋrʋ gɛtɛ aate ɛ ka ɛ sa ti gigyen fɔ. Gɛlɛ fɔ taà sʋma wɔ̀.<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Rehobwam e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san, gɩsarama fɔ yàà biri ba.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ da.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam e lila bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma wote Solomon, wɔ nkpa awi yaanɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ-mɔmɔ gɛ yaà tɛ mɩ nan ka n tiri bɛnɩ nyabɛ baade fɔ yiinyun n tɛ bɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Gɛ be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ǹdò aà mɛ ɛsʋmalɛ a tɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ, gɛ aà sʋma bɛ, gɛ aà tiri baade fɔ yiinyun gepe a tɛ bɛ fɔ, ɛbɛ mɔ baà mɛ aa bɛsaranyan gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Mɔ Rehobwam e terema bɛndɩrɛ fɔ baade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ, gɛ ɛ ma lila bɛsaranyanbi gɛtɛ ɛwɔ ma ɛbɛ bè di akʋsʋ, gɛ bɛɛ sʋma wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />E lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ-mɔmɔ gɛ yaà tɛ mɩ? Lan gɛ taà tiri ade nyayɩ yiinyun tɩ tɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩyɛra ditola gɛtɛ aate ɛ ka ɛ kyɔlɔga tɩ gigyen fɔ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Gɛ bɛsaranyanbi gɛtɛ bè di wakʋsʋ fɔ, be tiri wuunyun bɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Aate ɛ ka ditola-dɩrɛ e tola tɩ, mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, tɩyɛra dɩ tɛ tɩ&gt; fɔ alan, &lt;Aburu-buru ɩ lɛ, adɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɩ̀ sa gama. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Miinte e tola yɩ ditola ma ɔdʋrɔ, mɔ nmɩ nan yɛ dàà biri mɛ ɔdʋrɔ fɩya. Miinte ɛ ka gɛ binyanibi ɛ lanla yɩ, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, nan ka gɛ bikpemani n lanla yɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Awi asiyee yɩɩ gama fɔ, Yerobwam ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri bɛ san Rehobwam wakʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ biri ɩ ba gɩsarama fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn ka wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ, ɛ ŋmanyan bɛ gɛ. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Ɛ ka gɛ bɛsaranyanbi fɔ baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte e tola yɩ ditola ma ɔdʋrɔ, mɔ nmɩ miinyo daà nɩ da woyo fɔ. Miinte ɛ ka gɛ binyanibi ɛ lanla yɩ, mɔ nmɩ nan ka gɛ bikpemani n lanla yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn nʋn bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn, yema ade gɛtɛ i sere lɛ i ye Yahwe wakʋn, fɔ wàà yɛ Yahwe wade gɛtɛ ɛ dama Silon-te Ahiya wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam fɔ yàà ba waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu be we gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn nʋn baakʋn fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">&lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ ɛtɩ ma Dafidi wɔnana tɩ̀ ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Anʋn gɛ taà wura ti ye Yese wɔnana fɔ wakʋn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Oo Isareli bete! Ɩ san yaakwo yaanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Dafidi wɔnana, kpà ma aa dɩkpaara!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Okoro Isareli bete fɔ bɛ da baakpaara yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Mɔ Isareli bete gɛtɛ bè si Yuda atele yaanɩ fɔ bɩrɛ, Rehobwam ee di bugyu ɛ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ sa Adoniram, gɛtɛ nafɔ ɛɛ nya dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn gii koro fɔ Isareli bete baakʋn, mɔ Isareli bete powu be fun wɔ ataa be wolo. Wʋ ba gɛlɛ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ mɛ bilen e gyu wotiiramisan wanɩ gɛ e serenti ɛ da Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Anlɛ gɛ Isareli bete bɛ tɔ be yela Dafidi dɩkpaara dii koro bè sere ma ǹdò. <verse eid="1KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu bɛ nʋn alɛ Yerobwam e biri e ye Egyipiti ɛ ba fɔ, be kpèlè wɔ bɛ san boo getumakʋn, gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu bɛ tɛ Isareli powu. Yuda wofoli fɔ wuuko na kuruma gɛtɛ wʋ̀ tɛrɛma egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi dɩkpaara.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Gɛtɛ Rehobwam e bè gyu Yerusalem fɔ, ɛ kʋla Yuda ma Benyamin boo-ifoli yɩɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi yɛkɩ (180,000) gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà gepepe bàà ma kpa ma Isareli, fɔ èè biri to bugyu fɔ tɛ ɛwɔ Solomon wobi Rehobwam.<verse eid="1KI 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ ma wɔsaranyan Semaya alan, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />&lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ Solomon wobi Rehobwam Yuda wogyu ma Yuda dɩkpaara, ma Benyamin boo-ifoli powu, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ alan, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />&lt;&lt;Yahwe alan, &lt;Ɩ kara bʋn ɩ san ɩ ma kpà ma yɩɩwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Isareli bete fɔ. Ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ san wɔ dɩkpaara, yema nmɩ n tɛ mɛ wʋ gɛlɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ nʋn Yahwe wanyun-gyebi fɔ, ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ da wɔ dɩkpaara, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi ɩ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobwam e ye Wurubwarɛ gama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yerobwam e sere gɛsarakʋn Sekem, Efarim wo-idon yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ gɛ ɛ sara dʋkɔ. E ye dʋkɔ, gɛ ɛ ma sere ɔpɔrɩ e silin Peniyeli, gɛ ɛ sara dʋkɔ.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Gɛ Yerobwam ɛ dɔ̀ woturu waanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele bugyu fɔ baà biri bʋ̀ ba Dafidi dɩkpaara. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Gengyi bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɛ̀ bʋn bɛ san bɛ ma tɛ gedi Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ Yerusalem fɔ, baamɩnlɛ yaà biri i fi ɩ san boofonte Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam wakʋn. Baà wolo mɩ fɔ bàà biri san Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam wakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Gɛtɛ ɛ sara ma wamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ e were fɔ, ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ mɛ akwɔbi anyɔɔ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɩɩ gɛbʋn-waran Yerusalem fɔ wʋ̀ sɔ gʋsɔ. Oo! Isareli bete, ɩ nya yii bekpen, gɛtɛ be tiri yɩ be ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />E sere ekpen fɔ ɛkɩ Beteli, gɛ ɛ ka ɛnyɔɔfɛ fɔ ɛ ma sere Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Gɛ ade nyayɩ ɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen, yema bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ yɛ bɛɛ san sɩyɛɛ Dan bɛ ma sʋma ekpen fɔ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Yerobwam e ni sere akpen-kwo idon yii koro, gɛ e tiri bɛnɩ ɛ mɛ gedi gii bɛtɛlɛ e ye bɛnɩ powu baanɩ, ma gɛtɛ ben di Lefi bete gba fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Gɛ Yerobwam e tiri ebon-nɩyɛfɛ fɔ wo duwi fwo-tonfɛ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ ɔsɛ wuu gedi-dɩrɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bee di ɔsɛ Yuda fɔ. Gɛ ɛ tɛ gedi, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛ mɛ dɩkwɔbi gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Beteli fɔ, gɛ ɛ tɛ dɩ gedi. Gɛ e tiri gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Beteli wo-idon yii koro fɔ bàà tɩ tɛ gedi. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Ebon-nɩyɛfɛ wo duwi fwo-tonfɛ, n di ebon gɛtɛ ɛwɔ gbagba e tiri fɔ. Ɛ tɛ gedi, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ e sere Beteli fɔ gii koro. Okoro ɛ sɩ̀ ɔsɛ wuu gedi fɔ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete gɛ ɛɛ bʋn ɛ san gatala dʋkɔ ɛ ma tɛ gedi.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ Yahwe ɛ sa wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ e ye Yuda ɛ san Beteli, ɔya gɛtɛ Yerobwam è yela èè kuma olifwi. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Gɛ Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo bekpen boo gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn! Bekpen boo gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn! Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Baà wo ebi-tenibi ɛkɩ Dafidi dɩkpaara daanɩ, gɛtɛ baà kpèlè wɔ alɛ Yosiya. Awɔ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn nyagɩ, aa koro gɛ ɛɛ̀ ka bekpen boo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bee kuma olifwi bɛ tɛ bekpen fɔ ɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ baà kuma bɛnɩ baanankʋba aa koro.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke daanɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ mɛ dɩdawʋ e wùlà, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gaà yo anyɔɔ, gɛ bʋtɔ gɛtɛ bʋ̀ gyaga gii koro fɔ baà da bu lulu. Nyawʋ n di dɩdawʋ gɛtɛ daà wùlà alɛ Yahwe na tabʋrʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Yerobwam ɛ nʋn Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ wade gɛtɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ gyaga Beteli gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ, ɛ tʋna gʋlɔ e wùlà wɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I gye wɔ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ wɔ gʋlɔ gɛtɛ ɛ tʋna e wùlà wɔ fɔ, gi ku gɩ̀ fà, gɛ ɛn mɩnɩ talɩ birima gɩ. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ mɔ gi yo anyɔɔ, gɛ gɩɩ bʋtɔ fɔ bʋ da bu lulu, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔtabʋrʋlɛ wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, ma dɩdawʋ gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri onyun fɔ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ tɛ mɩ, fɔ mɩɩn gʋlɔ gàà biri ba giinundu.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e tiri onyun ɛ fɔ Yahwe gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gʋlɔ fɔ gi biri gɩ ba giinundu.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà san dɩkpaara, àà ma di gɩnyankɩ, fɔ nan kyɛ wɔ̀ anyan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi terema a yo aanyan gɛtɛ à ba fɔ ɔfan a tɛ mɩ gba fɔ, mɩn nan tɛrɛma wɔ n san, mɩn nan di, gɛ mɩn nan nyʋn butu nfan. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Yema Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ, n kara di, gɛ n kara nyʋn butu, gɛ n kara biri ma osele gɛtɛ na ka na san fɔ n ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Okoro ɛ ka gɛ ma osele-fon ɛ da. En mini biri ka ma osele gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ba Beteli fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Fɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa Beteli. Gɛ wo bebi-tenibi bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade powu gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ mɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ. Gɛ be biri bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ boote e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Osele-mɔmɔ gɛ ɛ ka e biri?&gt;&gt; Gɛ wo bebi fɔ be wùlà wɔ osele gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Yuda fɔ ɛ dama. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wo bebi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ pɩna dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɩ tɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛ pɩna dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ gyaga dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Gɛ ɛ tɛrɛma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ. Ɛ ma tama wɔ è si dɩlɛɛ dɩɩpɩ, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ n di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Yuda fɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, nmɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà san dɩkpaara, taà ma di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan talɩ n biri n tɛrɛma wɔ̀ n san n ma di abɛɛ n ma nyʋn butu nfan nyawʋ. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />Yema Yahwe wanyun-gyebi fɔ ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ n kara di, gɛ n kara nyʋn butu, gɛ n kara biri ma osele gɛtɛ na ka na san fɔ n ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Nmɩ mɔ n di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ anlɛ awɔ. Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ Yahwe alan, &lt;Biri ma wɔ ba aa dɩkpaara, fɔ èè be di, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyʋn butu.&gt; &gt;&gt; (Mɔ fɔ, ɛ gban wɔ gɛ.) <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Okoro Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e biri ɛ nyɩma wɔ ɛ san wɔ dɩkpaara, e di gɛ ɛ nyʋn.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Gɛtɛ bè si bee di fɔ, Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ gɛtɛ e birima wɔ ɛ ba fɔ, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e ye Yuda fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;An di Nmɩ Yahwe maanyun-gyebi yii koro, gɛ an di miinse, gɛtɛ Nmɩ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />A biri a san a ma di, gɛ a nyʋn ɔkʋn gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ kara di, gɛ kara nyʋn fɔ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɛn nan lò wɔ aate ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn fɔ gaanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e di gɛ ɛ nyʋn e were fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ ɛ pɩna wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Gɛtɛ ɛ̀ san osele waanɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ e ye e tuma wɔ, e wolo wɔ, gɛ wo gikpena gɩ̀ fɩna osele waanɩ. Gɛ wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ma ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fɔ bè yela wɔpɩ. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ ba bɛɛ da, gɛ be we gɛtɛ ekpena fɔ ɛ̀ fɩna dʋkɔ, gɛ ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fɔ mɔ è yela ekpena fɔ wɔpɩ. Gɛ bɛ san bɛ ma dɔ̀ ade fɔ ditele gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ ɛ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ e biri ma wɔ osele waanɩ fɔ ɛ nʋn ade fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gɛtɛ en di Yahwe wanyun-gyebi yii koro fɔ. Yahwe e tiri wɔ ɛ tɛ ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀. Ɛ fɛɛran wɔ gɛ e wolo wɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi fɔ ɩ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wo bebi alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ pɩna dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɩ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛ pɩna dɩ bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma we ekpena fɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fɩna osele waanɩ, gɛ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, ma ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fɔ bè yela wɔpɩ. Ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fɔ ɛn kɔrɔ ekpena fɔ, gɛ ɛn fɛɛran dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ mɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Okoro Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-tenikwaa fɔ ɛ ka Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ gikpena ɛ gyaga dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dii koro, gɛ e biri ma wɔ ɛ ba Beteli ditele daanɩ, bàà wula wɔ, fɔ bàà lò wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e lò wɔ ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ dɩtaa-fwe daanɩ, gɛ be wula wɔ, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Awo, miinobi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Gɛtɛ be lò wɔ be were fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wo bebi-teni fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi n ku fɔ, i lò mɩ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ be lò Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ. Ɩ ka maanankʋba ɩ sɩ̀ ɩ gbɛma woyo fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Yema Yahwe wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɛ dama wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ dama gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Beteli fɔ gii koro, ma akpen-kwo gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Samariya atele yaanɩ fɔ powu yaà ba waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Mɔ ade nyayɩ yɩɩ gama fɔ, Yerobwam en foma ye wade-kpen yiisele waanɩ, mɔ ɛ ni biri e tiri gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ e ye bɛnɩ powu baanɩ, gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ee ku wɔ ɛ mɛ ekpente. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Okoro ade nyayɩ ɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen ɩ tɛ Yerobwam dɩkpaara, gɛtɛ ɩ yɛ wɔ ɛ nʋ̀n gɛ e muru e ye gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yerobwam wobi-tenibi diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Yerobwam wobi Abiya e gyu geyeba. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yerobwam ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ fɔ, àà foma koro gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ kara nyɩnla alɛ, à di gɛ nmɩ, Yerobwam mɩɩnsɔ, fɔ àà san Silo. Nya, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ahiya, gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ, nan bɛ mɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ boogyu fɔ, ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Ka boroboro fwo, ma kyakpɛrɛ, ma ɛŋɔɔ parantwa ton, fɔ àà san wakʋn. Ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ waà sere ebi fɔ wo koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Okoro Yerobwam wɔsɔ ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ wɔsan ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ, gɛ ɛ san Ahiya dɩkpaara Silo ditele daanɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Fɔ Ahiya ɛn mɩnɩ taa ni we, wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ gbena, yema wɔ bɩkyan bɩ san bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Mɔ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Ahiya alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Yerobwam wɔsɔ ɛɛ ba èè bè lila wɔ̀ ade ka dama wobi-tenibi wo koro, yema wobi fɔ ee yeba. Anlɛ ma anlɛ gɛ aà dɔ̀ wɔ. Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔsɔ e be gyu fɔ, ɛ mɛ koro anlɛ è di gɛ ɛna-fon ɛkɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Okoro gɛtɛ Ahiya ɛ nʋn wɔ bɩsɩrɩ buu gekyikya wotunu fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gyu ba, Yerobwam wɔsɔ, anʋn yii koro gɛ a foma koro a mɛ ɛnɩ-fon? Bɛ sa mɩ ɔtʋn-kpen aakʋn. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />San fɔ àà ma dɔ̀ Yerobwam alɛ anlɛ gɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀, &lt;Na bʋma wɔ̀ na ye bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ na mɛ wɔ̀ Isareli bɛnɩ boogyegeyelɛ, <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />na lanla bugyu fɔ na ye Dafidi dɩkpaara daanɩ, gɛ na ka bʋ na tɛ wɔ̀. Mɔ an mɛ anlɛ mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi, gɛtɛ e di mii-ise yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka woturu powu ɛ tɛrɛma mɩ, gɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Mɔ awɔ, a mɛ ade-kpen a kààrà ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ̀ fɔ. A wura bekpen. A sʋma bekpen gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan bɛ mɛ fɔ. A fi gama a ten mɩ gɛ wʋ sa mɩ owurufa.<verse eid="1KI 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Gɛlɛ wuu koro, nan yɛ ade-kpen yàà ba Yerobwam dɩkpaara daanɩ. Nan wolo Yerobwam dɩkpaara diibi-teni-kamasɛ. Ye bɛdɩ ma sere bengyebi powu. Gɛ nan muru Yerobwam dɩkpaara muruyo, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sa ditonton ɔtan gɛ dii kpin muruyo fɔ ma sere gɛtɛ ɛyɩ powu yaà kpin. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Gɛ Yerobwam wɔnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè ku ditele-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, bɛkpɛɛ nan kɔrɔ wɔ, gɛ gatala gɩɩ bɛsɩsɩra baà di ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà ku akuraa ɛbɛ baanɩ fɔ. Yahwe na tabʋrʋ lɛ.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />&lt;&lt;Awɔ tɔ fɔ àà biri san dɩkpaara. Mɔ à bɔ aa gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ebi fɔ eè ku. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Isareli bete powu baà wula wɔ, bàà lò wɔ. Woko n di Yerobwam dɩkpaara dɩɩnɩ gɛtɛ baà lò, yema woko n di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ e we gɛtɛ ɛ̀ kɔlɔ ye Yerobwam dɩkpaara daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />&lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ̀ sɩ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ koro Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ, gɛtɛ eè wolo Yerobwam dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. Ade fɔ ɩ kya i ye ǹdò. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Gɛ Yahwe eè tiira Isareli bete giten èè kpenti bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ gifiye gii kpenti gɛkyɛrɛbayɩ getu-kere fɔ. Ɛɛ̀ tɔla Isareli bete e ye gɛtʋnkwaa-kpara nyagɩ gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ tɛ bootu ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ ɛɛ̀ yasɩ bɛ ɛ san Efurate getu giifèn, yema be sere ekpen Asera wo-iyon bɛ sa wɔ owurufa. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Gɛ eè tiri bʋnʋn e ye Isareli wo koro, yema Yerobwam wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Gɛ Yerobwam wɔsɔ ɛ tɔ ɛ da, gɛ ɛ ma gyu Tirisa. Gɛtɛ ɛ̀ bɔ ee sere gɩsɩrɩ wɔ dɩkpaara diitunu fɔ, ebi fɔ e ku. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Be lò wɔ, gɛ Isareli bebi powu be wula wɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔsaranyan Ahiya gɛtɛ è di wɔtabʋrʋlɛ wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Yerobwam bugyu baade, ma ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ powu fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yerobwam e di bugyu bɩkyan dɩkpɩlɩn ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e ku. Gɛ wobi Nadabi e di bugyu e sere wote gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Solomon wobi Rehobwam e di bugyu Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. E di bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma gɩkɩ pɛgɛ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu, gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan fwo-kwarankɩ Yerusalem, ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri e ye Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ powu yaanɩ, gɛtɛ bàà tɩ sʋma wɔ daanɩ fɔ. Wɔna è di Amon-na gɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Naama.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Yuda bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ baade-kpen ɩ sa wɔ owurufa wʋ kààrà ɛyɩ gɛtɛ bootu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Yema ɛbɛ mɔ be sere bekpen baasʋmakʋn, ma akpen-taa, ma ekpen Asera wo-iyon odon-kamasɛ wuu koro, ma oyon kusuu-kamasɛ wʋʋ gatɩn. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Gɛ Isareli beteni ma bɛnanɩ powu be gyu fotoli gɛmɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ. Gɛ bɛɛ mɛ ade-kyʋnlɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛnɩ-tuntun gɛtɛ bɛɛ sʋma bekpen bɛɛ mɛ, gɛ Yahwe e berema bɛ e ye gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam gɩkyan-tonfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ Sisaki ɛ tɔ e yela Yerusalem wo koro. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Gɛ e kpila agyu-nyan ma ɔyɛkɛma gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ, ma digyukpaara fɔ yaanɩ. Ɛ ka gɩnyan-kamasɛ, fɩya ma sɩka-sɩya awɔrɔnyan panpasan gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ ka sɩka-fututu ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka yɩ sere sɩka sɩya woyo fɔ yɩɩ bɩsɩrɩ. Gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sa bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu fɔ baalɔ. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛɛ ka yɩ be ton, gɛ gengyi be were fɔ, bee birima yɩ bɛ ma sɩ̀ bɛdɩyɛlɛ boo dikwo fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Rehobwam ɛ mɛ, ma wade-mɛlɛ powu fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Bɩtà buuko, buuko, na sara Rehobwam ma Yerobwam boo getite ɔya-kamasɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Rehobwam e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Rehobwam wɔna diyere n di Naama, è di gɛ Amon-na. Ɛwʋ gɛ wobi-tenibi Abiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Abiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Yerobwam wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Nebati wobi Abiya e di bugyu Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />E di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan besiyee. Wɔna diyere n di Maaka, gɛtɛ è di Abisalom wobi-nanɩbi fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen powu gɛtɛ wote ɛ sara gɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛn ka woturu powu tɛ Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Mɔ Dafidi wo koro fɔ, Yahwe gɛtɛ è di wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ɛ tɛ Abiya ebi-teni gɛtɛ eè be di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ Yerusalem, fɔ Yerusalem ditele dàà wura yela dɩɩ bɩsɩrɩ buu koro. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Yema Dafidi ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ en kere Yahwe wo-ise yii koro yii gedi ya wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ, Hiti-te Uriya woyo fɔ wuuko.<verse eid="1KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Akpa gɛtɛ ɩ sara Rehobwam ma Yerobwam boo getite fɔ, ɩ bɔ ɩ kyaga ma ye Abiya wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Gɛ bɛ ŋwara Abiya wade-mɛlɛ kurumakyɛɛ ma wo bugyu buuyo powu bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. Akpa i sere Abiya ma Yerobwam boo getite ɩ nya. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Asa e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Isareli wogyu Yerobwam gɩkyan dikpilinfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Asa ɛ bɛ mɛ Yuda wogyu. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem anɩ bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma dɩkɩ (41). Wonu diyere n di Maaka gɛtɛ è di Abisalom wobi-nanɩbi fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu akpɩn Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />E tiri beteni gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ afotoli-de fɔ powu e ye gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ e tiri bekpen-maralɛ, gɛtɛ wotu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />E tiri wonu Maaka gba gɛtɛ en mini di egyu-nanɩ, yema e sere ekpen Asera woyon. Asa e kebi wʋ ɛ fɩna gɛ e kuma wʋ Kidiron dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Ma gɛtɛ ɛn mɩna bekpen baasʋmakʋn idon yii koro gba fɔ, Asa ɛ ka woturu powu ɛ tɛ Yahwe wɔ nkpa wawi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Ɛ ka sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan gɛtɛ ɛwɔ ma wote bɛ ka bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ, ɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Gɛ akpa ɩ sara Asa ma Isareli wogyu Baasa boo getite ɔya powu gɛtɛ be di bugyu fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Baasa ɛ ma kpà ma Yuda, gɛ e sere ɔpɔrɩ e silin Rama ditele, gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ e gyu, gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ e ye Yuda wogyu Asa gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Asa e kpila sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wu kuruma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ, ma wo digyukpaara fɔ daanɩ. Ɛ ka ɛ sa wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi baalɔ yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ sa bɛ Tabirimon wobi Ben-Hadadi gɛtɛ wotu n di Esino gɛtɛ è di Aram wogyu, gɛ ee di bugyu Damasiko fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />Ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ nmɩ ma awɔ taà ta dikola, anlɛ gɛtɛ aate ma miinte bɛ sara fɔ. Nya n de sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya n tɛ tɩyɛma wɔ̀, fɔ àà kebi dikola gɛtɛ a ta ma Isareli wogyu Baasa fɔ, fɔ èè kere bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà ma nmɩ ɛ ya.<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ben-Hadadi e yera egyu-dɩrɛ Asa wade fɔ, gɛ ɛ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ Isareli watele-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ yaanɩ. Gɛ e gye Iyon, ma Dan, Abeli-Beti-Maaka, ma Kinereti fɩya ma Nafitali ntʋnkwaa powu bɩtà. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Baasa ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, e kere Rama ditele dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ ma sara Tirisa. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Asa ɛ yɛ be gbɛrɛ digbongbo bɛ tɛ Yuda bete powu. En tiri ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn ye waanɩ, gɛ bɛ ma tola ataa, ma iyon atoo-atoo, gɛtɛ Baasa è de ee sere ɔpɔrɩ e silin Rama ditele fɔ, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Asa ɛ ma ka yɩ e sere Geba ma Misipa atele Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Okoro bɛ ŋwara Asa wade-mɛlɛ powu wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wɔkɛma waade, ma atele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ e sere powu, bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ. Mɔ wɔ ditenikwaa daanɩ fɔ, e be wura bɩsɩrɩ buu geyeba. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Asa e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wote ɛbɛ bɔɔ dɩtaa-fwe daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Yehosafati e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Nadabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Asa gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ gɛ Yerobwam wobi Nadabi e di bugyu Isareli. Gɛ e di bugyu Isareli bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabi ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩn tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ tɛrɛma wote wo-isele, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete bɛ mɛ ade-kpen.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Ahiya wobi Baasa gɛtɛ e ye Isaka wofoli waanɩ fɔ, ɛ sa amɩnlɛ-kpen Nadabi wo koro, gɛ e wolo wɔ Gibeton, gɛtɛ wù di Filisiti bete boo ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Nadabi ma Isareli bete powu be silin Gibeton be tuma fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Okoro Baasa e wolo Nadabi, Yuda wogyu Asa gɩkyan-siyeefɛ fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ Baasa e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ e di bugyu fɔ, e wolo Yerobwam dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. En kere ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn ya nkpa, mɔ e muru dɩ powu anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔsaranyan Silo-te Ahiya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Yema ade-kpen gɛtɛ Yerobwam ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ bɛ mɛ, gɛ wʋ sa Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ owurufa fɔ wuu koro.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Nadabi ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma ɛyɩ powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Akpa ɩ sara Asa ma Isareli wogyu Baasa boo getite boo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋya powu waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Baasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Asa gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gaanɩ gɛ Ahiya wobi Baasa e di bugyu Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Ɛ sara Tirisa ditele daanɩ e di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan dikpilin ma bɩnaa. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Ɛwɔ mɔ ke ɛ nɩ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ tɛrɛma Yerobwam wo-isele, ma wade-kpen gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Yahwe ɛ dama Hanani wobi Yehu wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Baasa alan, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />&lt;&lt;Na tiri wɔ̀ na ye gɛ apututu yaanɩ, gɛ na mɛ wɔ̀ egyegeyelɛ na tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli, mɔ a san gɛ Yerobwam wo-isele yaanɩ, gɛ a yɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ, Isareli bete, bɛ mɛ ade-kpen, gɛtɛ wʋ sa mɩ owurufa. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro nan muru awɔ Baasa, ma aa dɩkpaara, gɛ nan mɛ aa dɩkpaara anlɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Bɛkpɛɛ nan kɔrɔ Baasa dɩkpaara dɩɩnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè ku ditele-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà ku dɩfa daanɩ fɔ, bɛsɩsɩra nan di bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Baasa ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wɔkɛma wade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baasa e ku gɛ be lò wɔ Tirisa, gɛ wobi Ela e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Yahwe ɛ da ma Hanani wobi Yehu gɛtɛ è di wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ Baasa ma wɔ dɩkpaara daade ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Yahwe gɛ wʋ sa wɔ owurufa fɔ wuu koro. Nka gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Yahwe ade-kpen fɔ wuuko, mɔ gɛtɛ e wolo Yerobwam dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu fɔ wuu koro.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Ela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Yuda wogyu Asa gɩkyan dikpilin ma kooronfɛ gaanɩ fɔ Baasa wobi Ela e di bugyu Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Ɛ sara Tirisa ditele daanɩ e di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Mɔ Simiri gɛtɛ è di wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya wɔ tiiramisan ɛbɛ ɔfan boo koro fɔ, ɛ ka amɩnlɛ-kpen wo koro. Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Ela ɛ̀ sa Tirisa ditele, Arisa dɩkpaara daanɩ gɛtɛ ɛ nyʋn bʋkan e suu. Fɔ Arisa nyawɔ ntɛ nya Tirisa digyukpaara dii koro. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Simiri e wolo wɔ, Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Asa gɩkyan dikpilin ma kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ. Gɛ e di bugyu.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ e di bugyu, gɛ ɛ sara gigyu-bɩya gii koro fɔ, e wolo Baasa dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. En kere eteni-kɩlɩn gba ya gɛtɛ è di wɔfʋrɩ, abɛɛ wɔwɔlɔn. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Okoro Simiri e muru Baasa dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yehu wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ kadama Baasa wo koro fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Baasa ma wobi Ela bɛ mɛ ade-kpen, gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bɛnɩ mɔ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen. Bɛ yɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ɛ ka owurufa yema bɛ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ sʋma bekpen. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Ela ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Simiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Asa gɩkyan dikpilin ma kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Simiri e di bugyu awi kwarankɩ Tirisa ditele daanɩ. Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be be len be silin Gibeton ditele, gɛtɛ dì di Filisiti bete boo ditele fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be tuma fɔ, bɛ nʋn alɛ Simiri ɛ ka amɩnlɛ-kpen egyu-dɩrɛ wo koro gɛ e wolo wɔ fɔ, Isareli bete powu bɛ ka Omiri gɛtɛ è di bɩtà bʋʋndɩrɛ fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu bɛ tɛ Isareli bete duwi dɩtɔkɔ boo getuma fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Omiri ma Isareli bete powu be ye Gibeton, gɛ bɛ ma sʋ Tirisa ditele bɛ sa. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Gɛtɛ Simiri e we gɛtɛ be to ditele fɔ, ɛ ma gyu digyu-dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ gɛ ɛ sa dɩ ɔtan e silin koro gɛ e ku. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Yema ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Yahwe, gɛtɛ ɛ tɛrɛma Yerobwam wosele ma wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete mɔ ke bɛ mɛ yɩ fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Simiri ɛ mɛ, ma wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wɔ gɛtɔ-yela bɛnɩ boo koro waade powu bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Omiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Simiri diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Isareli bete be yo akpen anyɔɔ. Dikpen dɩkɩ dɩ̀ tɛrɛma Ginati wobi Tibini, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ egyu, gɛ dikpen-do mɔ dɩ̀ tɛrɛma Omiri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Gamama fɔ, bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma Omiri fɔ be di ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma Ginati wobi Tibini fɔ boo koro. Tibini e ku, gɛ Omiri e di bugyu.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Yuda wogyu Asa wɔ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-dɩkɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Omiri e di bugyu Isareli bɩkyan fwo bʋnyɔɔ. Bɩkyan kooron gɛtɛ bù gyegeye wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ fɔ, ɛ sara gɛ Tirisa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />E se Samariya wodon fɔ, sɩka-fututu abi dikpilin e ye Semeri wakʋn, gɛ e sere ditele-dɩrɛ odon fɔ wuu koro, gɛ ɛ ka ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e fu odon fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ diyere Semeri ɛ sa dɩ alɛ Samariya.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Mɔ Omiri ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩ kààrà ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Ɛ bɔ ɛ tɛrɛma gɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam wo-isele powu, gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli bete bɛ mɛ ade-kpen bɛ sa Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ owurufa yema bɛ sʋma bekpen.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Omiri ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma ɔkɛma wade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade wʋ̀ gɩkpa fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omiri e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ Samariya, gɛ wobi Ahabi e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Ahabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Asa gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Omiri wobi Ahabi e di bugyu Isareli. Ɛ sara Samariya ditele daanɩ e di bugyu fɔ bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Omiri wobi Ahabi ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn gɛ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩ kààrà ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Nka alɛ ɛ mɛ gɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam wade-mɛlɛ fɔ yiiko, mɔ fɔ e biri e to Sidon bete boogyu Etibaali wobi-nanɩ Yesebeli gɩna ɛ fɩya. Gɛ ɛ sʋma ekpen Baali gɛ e kura wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />E sere dikpen-kwo ɛ tɛ ekpen Baali Samariya ditele daanɩ. Gɛ e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn dikpen-kwo fɔ daanɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Ahabi e biri e sere ekpen Asera woyon gɛ ɛ mɛ ade-kpen kpekpesi gɛtɛ ɩ sa Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ owurufa da Isareli begyu gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ bɛ sara fɔ powu.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Ahabi bugyu buu gedi gɩɩya waanɩ fɔ, Hiyeli gɛtɛ e ye Beteli fɔ, e biri ɛ pɩna e sere Yeriko. Gɛtɛ Hiyeli ee sere ditele fɔ geseregyagakʋn fɔ, wobi-teni ɛndɩrɛ Abiram e ku, gɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛɛ sa ditele fɔ dɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ èè were fɔ, wobi-teni, getu-gɔnɔ Segubi mɔ e ku, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama Nun wobi Yosuwa wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Kwankwandabi ɛbɛ bɛ tɛ Eliya anyan-dɩlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Eliya gɛtɛ e ye Tisibe ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Gileyadi fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Ahabi alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ ntɛ sʋma lɛ alɛ, dɩya abɛɛ ɛsʋn ɛn nan nʋ̀n bɩkyan bɛrɛɛ gɛtɛ bɩɩ ba lɛ, sɩyɛɛ na dɔ̀ alɛ ɛ nʋ̀n pɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Eliya alan, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />&lt;&lt;Ye nfan fɔ àà fi san ofila wʋʋ gɛtakʋn wʋʋ gɩlan, fɔ àà ma bu Keriti getu-bi gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Yodan getu giifila wʋʋ gɛtakʋn fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Aà nyʋn getu-bi fɔ gii butu, gɛ na wɛrɛ dɔ̀ kwankwandabi ɛbɛ alɛ bɛ tɩ̀ tɛ wɔ anyandilɛ dʋkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Okoro Eliya ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. Ɛ san Keriti getu-bi gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Yodan getu giifila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ sara dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Gɛ bɛkwankwandabi ɛbɛ fɔ bɛɛ tɩ̀ ka boroboro ma gɩnan bɛ mɔma wɔ gagyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ, gɛ ɛɛ nyʋn getu-bi fɔ gii butu.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya ma Sarefati wɔkpɩnsɔ fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Ɔya bɛrɛɛ wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, getu-bi fɔ gii butu bʋ nyʋn, yema ɛsʋn ɛn mɩnɩ taà nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe dɔ̀ wɔ alan, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Tɔ disere-kɩlɩn san Sarefati ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Sidon gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ, fɔ àà sara dʋkɔ. Nya, na wɛrɛ dɔ̀ ɛkpɩnsɔ ɛkɩ dʋkɔbɛ alɛ, ɛ tɩ̀ tɛ wɔ̀ anyandilɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Okoro Eliya ɛ tɔ ɛ da Sarefati. Gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu ditele fɔ diitunu fɔ, ɛkpɩnsɔ ɛkɩ è yela dʋkɔ ɛɛ tasɩ bʋtan. Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya e kpèlè wɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aà talɩ a tɛ mɩ butu bɛrɛɛ ma difirinbi nan nyʋn?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Gɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ fɔrɔ ɛ maà kpa butu fɔ ɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ, e kpèlè wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ gɛ, àà tɛ mɩ boroboro bɛrɛɛ fɩya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ alɛ, nn ma boroboro. Ǹ ba gɛ ɔnʋmʋ bɛrɛɛ lɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gubun gaanɩ, fɩya ma bʋnɔ bɛrɛɛ gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa parantʋwa anɩ. Na ba ntɛ kʋla bʋtan nan ka n san dɩkpaara fɔ nan ma ka wʋ n kpèlè, fɔ ɛtɩ ma miinbi-teni taà di taanyan-dɩlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ. Wʋʋ gama fɔ dɩkpan nan wolo tɩ fɔ tàà ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Mɔ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ̀! san dɩkpaara fɔ, àà ma mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ lɛ. Mɔ fɔ gyegeye kpa ɔnʋmʋ gɛtɛ à ba fɔ waanɩ bɛrɛɛ mɛ kyakpɛrɛ bɛ tɛ mɩ, wʋʋ gama fɔ àà mɛ gɩnyankɩ tɛ ɛyɩ ma aabi. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Yema Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Ɔnʋmʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gubun gaanɩ fɔ, wʋn nan were wʋ nya, gɛ bʋnɔ gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa parantʋwa anɩ fɔ mɔ, bʋn nan were, ma sere duwi gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ yɛ ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛkpɩnsɔ fɔ ɛ san ɛ ma mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Okoro anyandilɛ ɩ sara ɩ tɛ Eliya, ma ɛna fɔ ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ duwi-kamasɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Yema ɔnʋmʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gubun fɔ gaanɩ fɔ wun were wʋ nya, gɛlɛ ke gɛ bʋnɔ gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa parantʋwa anɩ fɔ mɔ, bun were anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama Eliya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Ɔya bɛrɛɛ wʋkɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩna fɔ wobi-tenibi fɔ e be gyu geyeba. Gɛ geyeba fɔ giinyun wʋ bɛ mɛ ɔkɛma gɛtɛ e belen ɔŋɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ e lila Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, anʋn yaade-kpen gɛ na mɛ wɔ̀? A ba à bɛ kʋna mɩ maade-kpen, fɔ àà wolo miinbi-tenibi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ka aabi fɔ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; E to ebi fɔ e ye walɔ yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ bʋn ɛ san gatala gii dikwo fɔ daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ dʋrɔ wɔ npa wo koro. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ tɛ Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, anʋn yii koro gɛ a wolo ɛkpɩnsɔ gɛtɛ na gyu wakʋn fɔ wobi-tenibi gɛ a yɛ gyerebi e di wɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ tʋna wo koro, ɛ dʋrɔ ebi fɔ wo koro disere disiyee, gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ tɛ Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, yɛ ebi nyawɔ wɔ nkpa èè biri ba wanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn Eliya wafala fɔ, gɛ ebi fɔ wɔ nkpa e biri e be gyu wanɩ gɛ e wura nkpa. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ ka ebi fɔ ɛ waran e ye gatala ɛ bɛ tɛ wɔna gatɩn gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, aabi fɔ ɛ̀ sa nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele, na we gɛtɛ à di gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ, gɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi gɛtɛ i ye aanyun waanɩ fɔ, ì di gɛ nʋnkwarɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya ma Obadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Ɔya kpekpesi wʋʋ gama, ɛsʋn fɔ geten wʋʋ gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;San, ka koro ma wùlà Egyu-dɩrɛ Ahabi, fɔ nan yɛ ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Okoro Eliya ɛ ka koro ɛ ma wùlà Ahabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Fɔ dɩkpan fɔ diinyun wʋ mɛ ɔkɛma Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ahabi e kpèlè Obadiya gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara dii koro fɔ. Obadiya e di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e to Yahwe e di gepepe. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Yesebeli ee wolo Yahwe bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, Obadiya ɛ ka bɛtabʋrʋlɛ akpilin ton e bubwa ataa-fwe anyɔɔ yaanɩ. Ɛ ka akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo e bubwa dɩtaa-kamasɛ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ anyandilɛ ma butu. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Gɛ Ahabi ɛ dɔ̀ Obadiya alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ taà san-san gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ taà gyu atu-bi, ma afobi powu yaanɩ, nkɩfɔ taà wura dɩfa-ŋɔɔ gɛtɛ taà ka ti tɛ taakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, ma taabengyi, fɔ tɩ kara be wolo tɩɩ bɛnan fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Okoro be yo gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ, gɛ Ahabi ɛ dama ofèn wʋkɩ, gɛ Obadiya mɔ ɛ dama ofèn-do.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Gɛtɛ Obadiya ɛ̀ san ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, e tuma Eliya. Obadiya e we wɔ ɛ nyɩnla, okoro ɛ waran e kura gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte Eliya wɔ lɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Gɛ Eliya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn! San ma dɔ̀ aafonte alɛ, &lt;Eliya ɛ̀ sa nfan.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Gɛ Obadiya e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaade-kpen gɛ na mɛ, gɛ à de nmɩ aasaranyan aa sa Ahabi gʋlɔ èè wolo? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Na nya Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ alɛ, gɩfɩɩ gɩkɩ abɛɛ bugyu bʋkɩ bʋn ma gɛtɛ miinfonte ɛn sa ɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ma bugiti wɔ̀. Gɛ gengyi gɩfɩɩ fɔ abɛɛ bugyu fɔ bʋ̀ dɔ̀ alɛ, an ma dʋkɔ fɔ, Ahabi ɛɛ yɛ bɛ bɛɛ kan ntam alɛ ben we wɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Gɛ aa dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ n san n ma dɔ̀ miinfonte alan, &lt;Eliya ɛ̀ sa nfan.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Mɩɩn nyɩ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Yahwe gifiye gaà ka wɔ gɩ san gengyi n kpe n ye aakʋn fɔ. Gengyi ǹ maà dɔ̀ Ahabi alɛ à sa nfan, gɛ en we wɔ̀ fɔ, eè wolo mɩ. Mɔ nmɩ aasaranyan na sʋma Yahwe ye sɩyɛɛ mɩɩn gɛsaranyan gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Miinfonte, an nʋn ade gɛtɛ na mɛ, ɔya gɛtɛ Yesebeli ee wolo Yahwe bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ? Na bubwa Yahwe bɛtabʋrʋlɛ akpilin ton ataa-fwe anyɔɔ yaanɩ. Na ka akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo na bubwa dɩtaa-fwe-kamasɛ daanɩ, gɛ na tɛ bɛ anyan-dɩlɛ ma butu. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Gɛ nkele aa dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ n san n ma dɔ̀ miinfonte alan, &lt;Eliya ɛ̀ sa nfan?&gt; Eè wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ alɛ, nan nyɩ n tiri koro n wùlà Ahabi ǹdò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya ma Ahabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Okoro Obadiya ɛ ma tuma Ahabi, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade fɔ, gɛ Ahabi ɛ ma tuma Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Gɛtɛ Ahabi e we Eliya fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ wɔ lɛ, awɔ n te len ade a ba Isareli anɩ fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Min len ade ba Isareli, mɔ awɔ, ma aate dɩkpaara na len ade na ba. Yema i kere Yahwe wo-ise fɔ ɩ ya, gɛ ɩ ma tɛrɛma bekpen Baali ɛbɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Nkele kpèlè Isareli bete powu, fɔ bàà be tuma mɩ Kameli wodon wuu koro, fɔ àà ka Baali bekpente nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (450), ma Asera bekpente nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400), gɛtɛ Yesebeli ɛɛ nya boo koro fɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Okoro Ahabi ɛ yɛ be kpèlè Baali bekpente powu Isareli anɩ, gɛ be tuma Kameli wodon wuu koro. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ san ɛ ma yela bɛnɩ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka ma sere ɔya-mɔmɔ gɛ yaà kere amɩnlɛ anyɔɔ-anyɔɔ yii gewura ɩ ya? Gengyi Yahwe ǹ di Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ɩ tɛrɛma wɔ, mɔ gengyi Baali ǹ di Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ɩ tɛrɛma wɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ ben tiri ade fɔ yiinyun. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ miinko na kuruma gɛtɛ n di Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ, mɔ Baali bekpente bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (450). <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Ɩ tɛ tɩ bɛkwɔ-teni bɛnyɔɔ, fɔ àà yɛ ɛbɛ gbagba bàà tiri ɛkwɔ-teni fɔ ɛkɩ, fɔ bàà kebi wɔ kpeti-kpeti bɛ gyaga bʋtan buu koro, mɔ bɛ kara sa ɔtan. Fɔ nmɩ mɔ nan kebi ɛkwɔ-teni-do fɔ n gyaga bʋtan buu koro, gɛtɛ mɩn nan sa ɔtan. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Fɔ yàà kpèlè yiikpen diyere, fɔ nmɩ mɔ nan kpèlè Miinfonte Yahwe diyere, gɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ eè yera ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ ɔtan wàà ye gatala be kuma bʋtan fɔ, ɛwɔ n di Wurubwarɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ Baali bekpente fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I tiri bɛkwɔ-teni fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ, fɔ yàà gyegeye kebi wɔ, yema ɛyɩ ǹ sɔ. I kpèlè yiikpen fɔ, mɔ ɩ kara sa bʋtan fɔ ɔtan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Okoro bɛ ka ɛkwɔ-teni gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ, gɛ bɛ kebi wɔ powu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Be kpèlè Baali ye gagyɩgyan ma sere ofila-kenken. Bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be kpèlè wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Baali, yera tɩ!&gt;&gt; Mɔ bɛn nʋn gɩta gɩkɩ, gɛ ɛkɩ en yera bɛ. Gɛ be lèn-lèn be silin gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Gɛtɛ wʋ nɩma ofila-kenken fɔ, Eliya ɛ sa bɛ dɩkpata alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ gbɛrɛ afala-kin-kin, yema è di gɛ ekpen, nkɩfɔ wamɩnlɛ ɩ da ɔfɔ, abɛɛ walɔ i de kààrà, abɛɛ ɛ da osele, abɛɛ ɛ fwa bʋda gɛ wʋ̀ di gɛtɛ bàà lama wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Okoro bɛ gbɛrɛ afala-kin-kin, gɛ be belen-belen koro bɛtata, ma bɩtʋrʋnyan anlɛ gɛtɛ boodu waanɩ waade-mɛlɛ ii wùlà fɔ, gɛ nkalan wu ye ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Gɛtɛ ofila wu yela atele wʋ kààrà fɔ, bɛ sangba bɛɛ gbɛrɛ afala be kpèlè bookpen fɔ ɔnʋn-sɩna waanɩ gɛlɛɛ ma sere gɛtɛ ɔgyɔlɔ wu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ wʋ nɩma. Mɔ bɛn nʋn ade ɩkɩ, ɛnɩ ɛkɩ en yera bɛ, gɛ ɛkɩ en nʋn baakʋn.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;I kpe ɩ gbɛma mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be kpe bɛ gbɛma wɔ, gɛ ɛ pɩna Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, gɛtɛ gɩ yasɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya ɛ ka ataa fwo anyɔɔ gɛtɛ dɩtaa-kamasɛ dì yela tɛ Yakobu wo-ifoli fɔ yaanɩ wʋkɩ. Yakobu nyawɔ gɛ Yahwe e foma wo diyere alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli&gt;&gt; fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ ka ataa fɔ e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn Yahwe diyere daanɩ. Gɛ e kunla difwe gɛtɛ daalun daà talɩ di ton butu galɔn besiyee e silin gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Ɛ pɩna bʋtan fɔ ɛ sa, gɛ e kebi ɛkwɔ fɔ kpeti-kpeti ɛ gyaga bʋtan fɔ buu koro, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kpà butu ɩ yɔla isun-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɩnaa, fɔ yàà da bʋ i lù gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ ma bʋtan fɔ buu koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I biri ɩ mɛ gɛlɛɛ dɩnyɔɔfɛ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ be biri bɛ mɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">E biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ mɛ gɛlɛɛ disiyeefɛ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ be biri bɛ mɛ gɛlɛ disiyeefɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Gɛ butu bʋ yɔn difwe gɛtɛ e kunla fɔ bʋ walɩ bu silin gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Gɛtɛ ɔya wʋ nɩma gɛtɛ bàà tɛ gedi fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Eliya e kpe ɛ gbɛma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɛ e tiri onyun ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, Abraham, ma Isaki, ma Isareli boo Wurubwarɛ, yɛ ǹdò bàà we nyɩnla alɛ, awɔ n di Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛ nmɩ n di aasaranyan, gɛ na yela gɛ aanyun-gyebi yii koro na mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ powu. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Oo Yahwe, yera mɩ! Yera mɩ! Fɔ bɛnɩ nyabɛ bàà nyɩnla alɛ, awɔ Yahwe n di Wurubwarɛ gɛ a biri aa fi boo-ituru bàà ba aakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ ɔtan wʋ ye gatala wʋ bɛ nʋ̀n, gɛ wu kuma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ, ma bʋtan fɔ, ma ataa fɔ, ma atɩn fɔ, gɛ wʋ yɛ butu fɔ bʋ nyʋn difwe fɔ daanɩ powu. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Ɔya gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be we ade nyayɩ fɔ, bɛ nʋ̀n bɛ ka bʋnʋn be tin gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe n di Wurubwarɛ, Yahwe n di Wurubwarɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;I gye Baali bekpente fɔ! I kara yɛ baanɩ-kɩlɩn èè serenti!&gt;&gt; Gɛ be gye bɛ, gɛ Eliya ɛ ka bɛ ɛ san Kison dɩtagba daanɩ, gɛ e belen ɛbɛ powu ayu dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ Ahabi alan, &lt;&lt;San ma di, fɔ àà nyʋn, yema na nʋn ɛsʋn-dɩrɛ getura.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Okoro Ahabi ɛ da ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma di fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyʋn. Gɛ Eliya ɛ bʋn Kameli wodon fɔ wuu duyu, gɛ ɛ waran e kura gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ ɛ warama wɔ bʋnʋn ɛ sa wakpin yii getite. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;San, fɔ àà ma nya ɛpʋ gɩlan!&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma nya, gɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Min we gɩnyankɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Disere kwarankɩ gɛtɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma nya àà ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Gɛ disere-kwarankɩfɛ, fɔ wɔsaranyan fɔ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na we dɩkpaba bɛrɛɛ gɛtɛ dì we anlɛ ɛnɩ-nyalɛ gʋlɔ gɛtɛ dɩ tɔ dii ye ɛpʋ fɔ anɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Eliya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma dɔ̀ Ahabi alan, &lt;Pɩna aa tiiramisan ɛbɛ, fɔ aa san dɩkpaara. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ ɛsʋn ɛɛ̀ bɛ sʋ wɔ̀ ɛ sa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Gɛtɛ wʋ mɛ bɛrɛɛ fɔ, akpaba diya-diya i tin gatala tumm, gɛ gifiye gɩ gbɛrɛ, gɛ ɛsʋn-dɩrɛ e sere. Gɛ Ahabi ɛ gyaga wo tiiramisan wo koro ɛ da Yesirele. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Gɛ Yahwe wɔkɛma wʋ waran wʋ ba Eliya wo koro, gɛ Eliya e li wɔ gɛgba gɛtɩɩ, gɛ e serenti ɛ da ɛ yɛ Ahabi ma wotiiramisan fɔ powu gɛlɛɛ ma gyu Yesirele.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya e serenti ɛ da Horebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Ahabi ɛ dɔ̀ Yesebeli ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Eliya ɛ mɛ, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ ka tata e wolo Baali bekpente powu fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Okoro Yesebeli ɛ sa Eliya ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsa ɔya nyawʋ wʋʋkʋna, gengyi mɩn mɛ wɔ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ a mɛ Baali bekpente fɔ, bekpen be wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Gɛtɛ gɩsaa gi ton Eliya okoro, ɛ tɔ e serenti, èè to wɔ nkpa. Gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu Beeseba, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yuda anɩ fɔ, e kere wɔsaranyan ɛ ya dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Mɔ ɛwɔ gbagba bɩrɛ ɛ san duwi-kɩlɩn diisele ɛ san otonkuma waanɩ. Ɛ ma sara oyon gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ ɔfɩya wuuyon fɔ wʋʋ gatɩn gɛ ee tiri onyun diku daà bɛ ka wɔ. Ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ kʋtɩ gɛlɛ! Oo, Yahwe, nkele to mɩɩn nkpa, mɩɩn kɔlɔ da miintu ɛbɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ oyon fɔ wʋʋ gatɩn gɛ ɛ fwa bʋda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ ɛ kya wɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ sara àà di!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Ɛ nya fɔ, e we boroboro ma ɔtan, ma butu gubun gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ wayu yaanɩ. E di, gɛ ɛ nyʋn, gɛ e biri ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Yahwe wɔsalɛ fɔ e biri ɛ ba dɩnyɔɔfɛ, gɛ ɛ kya wɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ sara fɔ àà di, yema osele wʋ̀ sangba wʋ̀ dɔ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Okoro ɛ tɔ ɛ sara, gɛ e di, gɛ ɛ nyʋn. Anyan-dilɛ fɔ ɩ tɛ wɔ ɔkɛma gɛ ɛ san osele fɔ awi akpilin anyɔɔ, odon ma ofilibon gɛlɛɛ ma gyu Horebi, Wurubwarɛ wodon fɔ wuu koro.<verse eid="1KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Dʋkɔ gɛ ɛ dʋrɔ dɩtaa-fwe dɩkɩ daanɩ e kpa kere.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1KI 19:9">Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà Eliya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma ɛwɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Eliya, anʋn gɛ aa mɛ nfan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Gɛ Eliya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na kpà na tɛ Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ-Kpatakpɩrɩ. Mɔ Isareli bete be furu dikola gɛtɛ a tà ma ɛbɛ fɔ gɛ be gbena aa gedi gɩɩ gaatɛ̀kʋn fɔ. Be wolo aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu, miinko na kuruma, gɛ nkele bee bugiti bàà wolo nmɩ mɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ye dɩtaa-fwe fɔ daanɩ, àà ma yela odon fɔ wuu koro, mɩɩn bʋnʋn, yema nmɩ, Yahwe ǹ bɛ̀ da ma dʋkɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Gɛ gifiye-dɩrɛ ma ɔkɛma gɩkɩ gɩ gbɛrɛ idon fɔ yii koro, gɛ ɩ tɛrɛ-tɛrɛ idon fɔ, gɛ gi gbena ataa buru-buru. Mɔ Yahwe ɛn ma gifiye-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. Gifiye fɔ gɩɩ gama fɔ, gɛtʋnkwaa gi kpenti, mɔ Yahwe ɛn ma gɛtʋnkwaa gii gekpenti fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Gɛtʋnkwaa gii gekpenti fɔ gɩɩ gama fɔ, ɔtan na ba, mɔ Yahwe ɛn ma ɔtan fɔ waanɩ. Ɔtan fɔ wʋʋ gama fɔ gɩta pɩɩ gɩkɩ gɩ ba. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Gɛtɛ Eliya ɛ nʋn gɩta fɔ, e gye wɔ gɛgba e tin wɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ e ye e be yela difwe fɔ diinyun.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Gɛ gɩta gɩkɩ gɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Eliya, anʋn gɛ aa mɛ nfan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Eliya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na kpà na tɛ Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ-Kpatakpɩrɩ fɔ. Mɔ Isareli bete be furu dikola gɛtɛ a tà ma ɛbɛ fɔ, gɛ be gbena aa gedi gɩɩ gaatɛ̀kʋn fɔ, gɛ be wolo aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu, miinko nan kuruma, gɛ nkele bee buguti bàà wolo nmɩ mɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Biri aa gama, ka osele gɛtɛ a ka a ba fɔ, fɔ àà san Damasiko wotonkuma waanɩ. Gengyi à gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, sʋrʋ Hasayeli bʋnɔ, fɔ èè di bugyu ɛ tɛ Aram bete. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Sʋrʋ Nimisi wobi Yehu mɔ bʋnɔ, fɔ èè di bugyu Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Fɔ àà sʋrʋ Safati wobi gɛtɛ e ye Abeli-Mehola fɔ bʋnɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ mɩɩntabʋrʋlɛ e sere aa gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Yehu eè wolo ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè serenti e ye Haseli wakʋn fɔ, gɛ Elisa mɔ eè wolo ɛwɔ gɛtɛ eè serenti e ye Yehu wakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Mɔ nan kere bɛnɩ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (7,000) n ya Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ ben kura ekpen Baali, gɛ bɛn kyʋkyʋ wɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa gekpèlè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Okoro Eliya e ye dʋkɔ, gɛ ɛ ma we Safati wobi Elisa gɛtɛ ɛ sa bɛkwɔ-teni gigyen ɩŋʋʋ bɛnyɔɔ-bɛnyɔɔ akpen fwo anyɔɔ bè de bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn. Gɛ ɛwɔ gbagba è de dikpen fwo-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ. Eliya ɛ bʋn ɛ san wakʋn, gɛ e fun wɔ gɛgba ɛ gyaga Elisa wo koro.<verse eid="1KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Okoro Elisa e kere wɔ bɛkwɔ-teni fɔ ɛ ya, gɛ e serenti ɛ tɛrɛma Eliya, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ mɩ nan ma mù miinte, ma mɩɩnna n kala, fɔ nan bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Gɛ Eliya e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yoo! Biri san, Mɩn sʋn wɔ̀!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Elisa e kpe e ye wakʋn ɛ da, ɛ ma wolo bɛkwɔ-teni fɔ. Ɛ ka iyonbi gɛtɛ ɛ ka sa bɛkwɔ fɔ gigyen gɛ bè de bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ ɛ sa ɔtan ɛ gyaga gɩnan fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ e yo bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ kɔrɔ. Gɛ ɛ tɔ ɛ tɛrɛma Eliya, gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔsaranyan.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ben-Hadadi ɛ ta bɩtà ma Samariya gɩfɩɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Aram wogyu Ben-Hadadi ɛ kʋla wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ e tuma, gɛ begyu-dɩrɛ dikpilin ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ ma baabengyi, ma boo tiiramisan ɛbɛ, bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma tà bɩtà ma Samariya. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Gɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Ahabi wakʋn wo ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ben-Hadadi alan, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />&lt;Aa sɩka-fututu, ma aa sɩka-sɩya, ma aasɔ ɛbɛ-kpara, ma aa bebi-kpara powu, bè di gɛ miinyo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wogyu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwʋ gɛ a dɔ̀ lɛ, miinfonte, egyu-dɩrɛ, nmɩ ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ǹ ba fɔ, tì di gɛ aayo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Gɛ Ben-Hadadi e biri ɛ sa bɛnɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ben-Hadadi ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Na sa bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ ka aa sɩka fututu, ma aa sɩka-sɩya, ma aasɔ ɛbɛ, ma aa bebi tɛ mɩ.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Mɔ gɩsa ɔya nyawʋ anlɛ, nan sa mɩɩn bɛndɩrɛbi bàà ma yasɩ aa digyukpaara, ma aa bɛndɩrɛbi baakpaara. Gɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di gɩnyan-gbaa tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, baà ma ka bɛ da.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ e kpèlè gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ powu e tuma, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya anlɛ gɛtɛ ete nyawɔ ee len ade. Gɛtɛ ɛ sa alɛ be be to mɩɩnsɔ ɛbɛ, ma miin bebi, ma mɩɩn sɩka-fututu, ma mɩɩn sɩka-sɩya fɔ, min terema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Gɛ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kara nʋn wakʋn, gɛ kara tɛ wɔ anyan gɛtɛ ee lila fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Okoro e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Ben-Hadadi bɛsalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ miinfonte, egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ a gyegeye a lila aasaranyan fɔ, nan mɛ, mɔ ɛwʋ nyawʋ bɩrɛ, mɩɩn nan yera.&gt; &gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛsalɛ fɔ be biri bɛ da gɛ be birima ade fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Ben-Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Gɛ Ben-Hadadi e biri ɛ sa bɛnɩ-fon Ahabi wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi mɩn mɩna Samariya ditele powu gɛ atɩn ì kuruma gɛtɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ ɛkamasɛ èè wura gʋlɔ gii diboro fɔ, bekpen be wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Wun di gɛtɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ sa akpa yɩɩ gɛgba fɔ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ bʋma koro anlɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ee lo gɩ fɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Ben-Hadadi ɛ nʋn ɔtʋn nyawʋ fɔ, fɔ ɛwɔ ma wo begyu bɛɛ nyʋn bʋkan dɩyan dii dikwo daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ban gbagya taà san bɩtà!&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ bàà tà ditele fɔ bɩtà.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabi e di Ben-Hadadi wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ ba Isareli wogyu Ahabi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;A we bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ kpekpesi nyabɛ? Nan ka bɛ n sa aa gʋlɔ ǹdò, fɔ àà nyɩnla alɛ, nmɩ n di Yahwe.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Gɛ Ahabi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan mɛ ade nyayɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di bɛndɩrɛbi tɛ atele fɔ nan mɛ.&gt; Gɛ Ahabi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan gyegeye ɛ tà bɩtà fɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;Awɔ.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Ahabi e kpèlè bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di bɛndɩrɛbi tɛ atele fɔ e tuma. Bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin ma fwo-bɛnyɔɔ (232). Gɛ e kpèlè Isareli bɛnɩ kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu e tuma. Bɛ̀ ba bɛnɩ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (7,000).<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Gɛ bɛ tɔ ofila-kenken bɛ da bɩtà fɔ, fɔ Ben-Hadadi ma begyu dikpilin ma fwo-bɛnyɔɔ, gɛtɛ bɛɛ kpà wɔ fɔ, bɛ̀ sa dɩyan dii dikwo daanɩ bɛ nyʋn be su. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di bɛndɩrɛbi tɛ atele fɔ na gyegeye na san.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Gɛ Ben-Hadadi wɔ bɛnɩ-dɩyɛlɛ fɔ, bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be ye Samariya bɛɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi bɛɛ ba gɛ olila waanɩ fɔ, i gye bɛ gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ. Gengyi bɛɛ ba gɛ akpa fɔ, i gye bɛ gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Gɛ Isareli bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bè di bɛndɩrɛbi tɛ atele fɔ, be gyegeye be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ, gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu bɛ tɛrɛma bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Gɛ baanɩ-kamasɛ e wolo wokengbelilɛ, Aram bete be serenti, gɛ Isareli bete bɛ kpà bɛ gyaga boo koro. Mɔ Aram wogyu Ben-Hadadi ɛ ka wo dibengyi gɛ ɛbɛ ma wabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ be serenti. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ tɛrɛma bɛ, gɛ ɛ ma gye abengyi ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ, gɛ e wolo Aram bete fɔ kpekpesi.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ ba Isareli wogyu Ahabi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Sa koro ɔkɛma, fɔ àà pɩna koro gepepe, fɔ àà nya isele gɛtɛ aà ka. Yema gɩkyan-fon ɔya nyawʋ wʋʋkʋnan anlɛ, Aram wogyu eè biri ɛ bɛ tà wɔ̀ bɩtà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Gɛ Aram wogyu bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ tɛ wɔ amɩnlɛ alan,&lt;&lt;Boo bekpen fɔ bè di gɛ idon yii bekpen, gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ bɛ ba ɔkɛma da tɩ fɔ. Mɔ gengyi tɩ̀ tà bɩtà ma ɛbɛ ɔtalɩ waanɩ fɔ, wʋ̀ mɛ laan fɔ taà wura ɔkɛma tɩ da bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Nkele tiri begyu fɔ powu gɛtɛ bɛɛ kpakya fɔ, fɔ àà ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ a sere bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Gɛ wù di gɛtɛ àà kʋla bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, bàà sɔ anlɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be wolo fɔ, aabengyi, ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ powu baasɔ yaà mɛ kyɛkyɛ anlɛ ɛyɩ gɛtɛ be wolo fɔ. Fɔ taà ma kpà ma Isareli bete ɔtalɩ waanɩ, yema wʋ̀ mɛ laan fɔ taà wura ɔkɛma tɩ da bɛ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ nʋn baakʋn, gɛ ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Gɛtɛ okenanfile wu biri wʋ nɩma fɔ, Ben-Hadadi e kʋla Aram bete, gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ san Afeki, ɛ ma kpà ma Isareli bete.<verse eid="1KI 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete fɔ bɛ kʋla gɛ be yo bɛ anyandilɛ ma akpa yaanyan hiyanlɛ be were fɔ, bɛ tɔ bɛ da bɛ ma tuma bɛ. Isareli bete be sere asarakʋn buru-buru anyɔɔ Aram bete boofèn anlɛ begbebi baakpi mɔ Aram bete bɛ walɩ ɔtalɩ fɔ waanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Isareli wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Gɛtɛ Aram bete bɛɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ Yahwe è di gɛ idon yiikpen, mɔ en di gɛ ɔtalɩ wuukpen okoro nan ka bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan nyadɩ n sa aa gʋlɔ, fɔ àà nyɩnla alɛ, nmɩ n di Yahwe fɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Bɛ sara ofèn ma ofèn ma bɛwɔlɔn awi kwarankɩ, gɛ duwi kwarankɩfɛ fɔ, akpa fɔ i sere. Gɛ Isareli bete bɛ nyaara Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi ton (100,000) duwi-kɩlɩn daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Gɛ bekurumakyɛɛ fɔ be serenti be san Afeki ditele daanɩ, gɛ ɔpɔrɩ wu sila wu tin bɛnɩ disepekyi ma ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (27,000).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:30">Gɛ Ben-Hadadi mɔ e serenti ɛ ma gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ, gɛ e bu gamɩ wuu dikwo dɩkɩ daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Gɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, tɩ nʋn alɛ Isareli dɩkpaara dii begyu-dɩrɛ fɔ bè di begyu gɛtɛ bee we ɛnɩ gutunkoro. Okoro yɛ tàà liba bekotoku, fɔ tàà ka ɩŋʋʋ ti milin bigyen, fɔ tàà san Isareli wogyu wakʋn, nkɩfɔ ɛɛ̀ yɛ wɔ̀ àà sara nkpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Okoro be liba bekotoku, gɛ bɛ ka ɩŋʋʋ be milin bigyen, gɛ bɛ san Isareli wogyu wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Aasaranyan Ben-Hadadi alan, &lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ mɩ nan sara nkpa.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Gɛ egyu lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ̀ sangba è si nkpa? È di gɛ miinnobi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Bɛnɩ fɔ, bɛ̀ nyɩ alɛ ade-kpara gɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀, okoro be yera alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn! È di gɛ aanobi&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma ka wɔ ɩ mɔma mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ Ben-Hadadi e be gyu fɔ, Ahabi ɛ yɛ wɔ e be gyu wo tiiramisan anɩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Gɛ Ben-Hadadi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Atele gɛtɛ miinte e to e ye aate wakʋn fɔ, nan birima yɩ n tɛ wɔ̀, gɛ a talɩ a sere awɔ gbagba aa gɩyɛ gaadikʋn Damasiko, anlɛ gɛtɛ miinte ɛ mɛ Samariya fɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Gɛ Ahabi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Dikola nyadɩ dɩɩ gɛtà wuu koro, waà yɛ wɔ̀ àà wura koro.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ tà dikola ma ɛwɔ, gɛ e tiri wɔ osele.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ e tin Ahabi dɩpwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dama wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ wɔwɔlɔn alan,&lt;&lt;N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, gbɛrɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Mɔ wɔwɔlɔn fɔ e terema.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ an di Yahwe wanyun-gyebi yii koro lɛ, à bo a kpe a ye maakʋn pɛ ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ eè wolo wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Gɛ gɛtɛ ete fɔ e bo e kpe e ye wakʋn ɛ da fɔ, ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ e tuma wɔ gɛ e wolo wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e biri e we ete-fon ɛkɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, gbɛrɛ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Okoro ete fɔ ɛ gbɛrɛ wɔ e pira. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ san ɛ ma yela osele-kere ee so egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ ka diyenkpen ɛ ban wɔ bʋnʋn, gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛ kara nyɩnla wɔ. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ da fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e kpèlè wɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Aasaranyan ɛ san bɩtà baanɩ, gɛ bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛkɩ e gye ete ɛkɩ bɩtà gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ mɔma mɩ alan, &lt;Nya ete nyawɔ wo koro, gengyi à yɛ wɔ e serenti fɔ, aà ka aa nkpa a le gutoro, abɛɛ aà le sɩka-fututu abi gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ waà mɛ kilo dikpilin ma fwo bɛnaa (34).&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Ɔya gɛtɛ aasaranyan bʋnʋn bʋ sɩna dɩbɩyan ma ologyi fɔ, ete fɔ ɛ nyʋn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;A tin koro dɩpwɛ, gɛ wù di gɛtɛ àà wura wuu giten-tiira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bilenten ɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e tirima diyenkpen gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ban bʋnʋn ma duyu fɔ powu, gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ nyɩnla wɔ gɛtɛ è di Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;A kere ɛnɩ gɛtɛ na mɛ gɛtɛ èè ku fɔ a ya. Gɛlɛ wuu koro, aà ka aa nkpa a to wɔ nkpa, gɛ aà ka aa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ nkpa a to wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ booyo, yema a yɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛkɩ be serenti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wogyu e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ Samariya, owurufa ma koro gɩɩ gɛyɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Naboti wɔ wayɩn woli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Ɔya wʋkɩ wʋ bɛ da fɔ, ade ɩkɩ i sere ka dama wayɩn woli gɛtɛ wù di Yesirele-te Naboti woyo fɔ wuu koro. Wayin woli fɔ wʋ̀ sa Yesirele, gbɛma Samariya wogyu Ahabi digyukpaara. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ahabi ɛ dɔ̀ Naboti alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ aa wayɩn woli fɔ wʋ̀ gbɛma miin digyukpaara okoro, ka wʋ tɛ mɩ, nan fʋn nkwan wanyamanyan waanɩ. Fɔ nan tɛ wɔ wayɩn woli-kpara abɛɛ nan le wɔ wʋʋ gɩyɛ gɛtɛ wʋ kʋtʋma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Mɔ Naboti e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ ka ɛ san ɔfɔ, gɛtɛ nan ka miintu ɛbɛ baadikurumanyan n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Okoro Ahabi ɛ da dɩkpaara ma koro gɩɩ gɛyɔ ma owurufa, yema Yesirele-te Naboti ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan ka miintu ɛbɛ baadikurumanyan n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Ɛ san ɛ ma waran ɛ dʋrɔ wɔ npa wo koro gɛ e fi wɔ bʋnʋn e ten ɔpɔrɩ gɛ e terema en di.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Wɔsɔ Yesebeli ɛ ba wakʋn, gɛ e be lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ à si koro gɩɩ gɛyɔ gaanɩ gɛlɛ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ an di?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yema na dɔ̀ Yesirele-te Naboti alan, &lt;Fu aa wayɩn woli fɔ tɛ mɛ, abɛɛ gengyi aa len fɔ nan ka wayɩn woli-kpara-fon n sere wʋʋ bɩsɩrɩ.&gt; Mɔ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;Mɩn nan ka miin wayɩn woli fɔ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Wɔsɔ Yesebeli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ gɛtɛ à di Isareli wogyu fɔ, anlɛ gɛ aà mɛ? Tɔ, fɔ àà di! Furu koro! Nan to Yesirele-te Naboti wɔ wayɩn woli fɔ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Okoro ɛ ŋwara akpa Ahabi diyere daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka Ahabi dɩdawʋ ɛ gyaga yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ tɩyɛma bɛndɩrɛbi ma bengyebi, gɛtɛ ɛbɛ ma Naboti bè si ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Ɛ ŋwara akpa fɔ yaanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;I tiri duwi ɩ sɩ̀ ɩ tɛ onyun wuu gɛban, fɔ yàà yɛ Naboti ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara gɛsarakʋn-dɩrɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Mɔ ɩ yɛ bɛnɩ-teni bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ fɔ bàà sara wɔ bʋnʋn ofèn, fɔ bàà belen ade gyaga wo koro alan, &lt;Naboti ɛ fwala Wurubwarɛ ma egyu-dɩrɛ.&gt; Wʋʋ gama fɔ ɩ ka wɔ i ye okòro, fɔ yàà fun wɔ ataa i wolo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Okoro bɛndɩrɛbi ma bengyebi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Naboti ditele daanɩ fɔ, bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yesebeli wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ ŋwara fɔ ii wùlà fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Be tiri duwi bɛ sɩ̀ bɛ tɛ onyun wʋʋ gɛban, gɛ bɛ yɛ Naboti ɛ sara gɛsarakʋn-dɩrɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ-teni bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ fɔ bɛ bɛ sara wofèn, gɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ ade bɛ gyaga Naboti wo koro alan, &lt;&lt;Naboti ɛ fwala Wurubwarɛ ma egyu-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ ka wɔ be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ, gɛ be fun wɔ ataa be wolo. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Gɛ bɛ sa Yesebeli ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Be fun Naboti ataa, gɛ e ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Gɛtɛ Yesebeli ɛ bɔ ɛ nʋn alɛ be fun Naboti ataa be wolo fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Ahabi alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ, fɔ àà ma ka Yesirele-te Naboti wɔ wayɩn woli gɛtɛ e terema èè fu tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ. Yema ɛn mɩnɩ ma nkpa anɩ, mɔ e ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Gɛtɛ Ahabi ɛ nʋn alɛ Yesirele-te Naboti e ku fɔ, ɛ tɔ ɛ san ɛ ma ka Naboti wo wayɩn woli fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Tisibi-te Eliya alan, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />&lt;&lt;San Isareli wogyu Ahabi, gɛtɛ ee di bugyu Samariya fɔ wakʋn. Ɔkʋna nyawʋ, ɛ̀ sa Naboti wɔ wayɩn woli gɛtɛ e to fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, Yahwe alan, &lt;Gɛtɛ a wolo ɛnɩ a were fɔ, à biri aa to wanyan?&gt; Fɔ àà dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛkpɛɛ bɛ nʋnʋn Naboti wɔ nkalan fɔ, dʋkɔ ke gɛ bɛkpɛɛ baà nʋnʋn awɔ mɔ aa nkalan.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ahabi ɛ dɔ̀ Eliya alan, &lt;&lt;Okoro mɩɩnkyʋnlɛ, a we mɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn na we wɔ, yema a fu koro a tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Nan yɛ dɩyɩyɛ dàà ba aa koro. Nan muru aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ, gɛ nan wolo awɔ Ahabi aa dɩkpaara diibi-teni-kamasɛ, bɛdɩ, abɛɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be to koro powu Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Nan mɛ aa dɩkpaara anlɛ gɛtɛ na mɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam, ma Ahiya wobi Baasa booyo fɔ, yema a sa mɩ owurufa, gɛ a yɛ Isareli bete bɛ mɛ ade-kpen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Gɛ Yesebeli bɩrɛ, Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Bɛkpɛɛ baà kɔrɔ Yesebeli Yesirele ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />&lt;&lt;Bɛkpɛɛ baà kɔrɔ ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ è di Ahabi wɔnɩ, gɛtɛ eè ku ditele daanɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛsɩsɩra baà di ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà ku dɩfa daanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />(Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma anlɛ Ahabi gɛtɛ e fu wo koro ɛ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛtɛ wɔsɔ Yesebeli ɛ tɛ wɔ amɩnlɛ-kpen. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kyʋnlɛ-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ sʋma bekpen anlɛ Amori bete gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema bɛ e ye gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Gɛtɛ Ahabi ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba, gɛ e liba bekotoku gɛ ɛ ban onyun, e liba bekotoku gɛ ɛ sara dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ. Gɛtɛ kere gɩ kpa fɔ, ɛ yɛ ɛ̀ san ma amɩnlɛ.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Tisibe-te Eliya alan, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />&lt;&lt;A we anlɛ gɛtɛ Ahabi ɛ warama koro mɩɩn bʋnʋn? Anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ warama koro mɩɩn bʋnʋn, okoro mɩn nan nɩ ka dɩyɩyɛ fɔ n ba wawi yaanɩ, mɔ nan ka n ba gɛ wobi-teni wawi yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Mikaya e terema ɛ tɛ Ahabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Bɩkyan bisiyee powu baanɩ fɔ, olila wʋ sara Aram ma Isareli boo getite. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Mɔ gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gɩɩ geweremakʋn fɔ, Yuda wogyu Yehosafati ɛ san Isareli wogyu wakʋn. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn nyɩ̀ alɛ Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele dì di tiiyo, mɔ tɩn taa mɛ ade ɩkɩ alɛ taà ma to di ti ye Aram wogyu wakʋn?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Gɛ e lila Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Aà fɩya ma nmɩ, taà ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yehosafati e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Isareli wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛtɩ ma awɔ tì di gɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn, mɩɩn bɛnɩ bè di gɛ aa bɛnɩ, gɛ maabengyi ì di gɛ aabengyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Mɔ Yehosafati e biri ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Gyegeye lila Yahwe gelenbi pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Okoro Isareli wogyu ɛ kʋla Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu gɛtɛ baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400), gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;N san n ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele, abɛɛ n kara n san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;San, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka dɩ ɛ sa awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ aa gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Mɔ Yehosafati e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛn mɩnɩ ma fɩya gɛtɛ taà lila wɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa gɛtɛ taà talɩ ti lila wɔ Yahwe gelenbi, mɔ n tɛ kyʋn wɔ, yema ɛn tɛ dɔ̀ ade-kpara ka dama miin koro nya kpakpaakpa, mɔ ɔya-kamasɛ fɔ, ade-kpen yiiko-yiiko gɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀. Ɛwɔ n di Imila wobi Mikaya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehosafati ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wun di gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ gɛlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Okoro Isareli wogyu ɛ sa wɔsaranyan ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma ka Imila wobi Mikaya ba nfan nkenkele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Fɔ Isareli wogyu Ahabi, ma Yuda wogyu Yehosafati bɛ̀ sa baagyu-nyan bè si bugyu-bɩya bii koro ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee tiba afabi Samariya ditele diitunu-yon fɔ. Fɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu bè si bɔɔ bʋnʋn bɛɛ tabʋrʋ. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Gɛ Baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Sedekiya gɛ wote n di Kenaana fɔ, ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan yaakantan, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Akantan nyayɩ gɛ aà ka a kpà ma Aram bete ma sere gɛtɛ aà muru bɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Bɛtabʋrʋlɛ-do fɔ powu bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ ade-kɩlɩn alan, &lt;&lt;Ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele, fɔ àà di dii koro, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka di ɛ sa egyu-dɩrɛ gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Ɛsalɛ gɛtɛ ɛ san ɛ ma kpèlè Mikaya fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, bɛtabʋrʋlɛ-do fɔ powu bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ ade-kɩlɩn be wùlà gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ eè di akpa fɔ yii koro. Okoro yɛ aanyun-gyebi yàà mɛ dɩkɩlɩn ma booyo, fɔ àà tabʋrʋ ade-kpara.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Mɔ Mikaya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ alɛ, nan bɔ n dɔ̀ wɔ gɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Gɛtɛ e be gyu fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mikaya, n ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi, abɛɛ n kara san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt; Ma kpà, aà di boo koro, yema Yahwe ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sa aa gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Disere dilen gɛ aa le mɩ nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà kan ntam tɛ mɩ alɛ an taa dɔ̀ ade-fon ɩkɩ, mɔ fɔ nʋnkwarɩ gɛ aa dɔ̀ mɩ Yahwe diyere daanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Gɛ Mikaya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Isareli bete powu bɛ yasɩ idon yii koro, anlɛ bɛyɛran gɛtɛ bɛn ma ɛnyalɛ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɛn ma ɛnyalɛ. Yɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san wɔ dɩkpaara olila waanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ, ɛn taa dɔ̀ ade-kpara ka dama miin koro, mɔ ade-kpen yiiko-yiiko?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Mikaya e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele nʋn ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀, &lt;Na we Yahwe è si wo gigyu-bɩya gii koro, gɛ gatala gɩɩ dɩtɩnpan fɔ powu be silin wɔ dɩbɩyan ma ologyi. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Gɛ Yahwe e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan ma gban Ahabi, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi bàà wolo wɔ dʋkɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ anlɛ, gɛ edo mɔ ɛ dɔ̀ lɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Gamama fɔ gifiye-kpen gɩkɩ gi ye gi be yela Yahwe bʋnʋn gɛ gɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nmɩ nan ma gban wɔ.&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Gɛ Yahwe e lila wɔ alan, &lt;Osele-mɔmɔ gɛ aà ka?&gt; Gɛ gifiye fɔ gi tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nan ye n san nan ma mɛ didebila dii gifiye wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu boonyun waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aà talɩ a gban wɔ, okoro san fɔ àà ma mɛ gɛlɛ.&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ ka didebila dii gifiye ɛ sa aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ nyabɛ powu boo-inyun yaanɩ. Yahwe ɛ wɛrɛ mɛ gɛtɛ eè muru wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Gɛ Kenaana wobi Sedekiya ɛ bʋn ɛ ma gbɛrɛ Mikaya ɔtan gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Duwi mɔmɔ gɛ Yahwe gifiye gi ye maanɩ gɩ ma tabʋrʋ ma awɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Duwi gɛtɛ aà serenti a ma bu dikwo dɩɩ gamɩ fɔ, gɛ aà we a nyɩnla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka Mikaya, fɔ àà birima wɔ ma tɛ Amon, gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ditele dii koro fɔ, ma egyu-dɩrɛ wobi Yowasi. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Fɔ yàà dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;Ɩ ka wɔ ɩ ma tan dikwo, gɛ ɩ kara tɛ wɔ gɩnyankɩ ɩ fɩya ma boroboro, ma butu buuko, ma sere gɛtɛ nan biri n ba olila waanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Mikaya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à biri a ba olila waanɩ fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ Yahwe ɛn dama miin koro tabʋrʋ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ powu, ɩ nʋn maanyun-gyebi ɩ sɩ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabi diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Okoro Isareli wogyu Ahabi, ma Yuda wogyu Yehosafati bɛ bʋn bɛ da Ramoti-Gileyadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ nan foma koro, n gyu akpa fɔ yaanɩ, mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, sa aagyu-nyan.&gt;&gt; Okoro Isareli wogyu e foma koro, gɛ e gyu akpa fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Aram wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ dikpilin ma fwo bʋnyɔɔ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ebi oo, ɛndɩrɛ oo ɩ kara kpà ma ɛnɩ-kamasɛ, ɩ kpà gɛ ma Isareli wogyu woko.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Gɛtɛ tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ be we Yehosafati fɔ, bɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ wù di Isareli wogyu. Okoro be fi bɛ̀ ma kpà ma ɛwɔ, mɔ gɛtɛ Yehosafati e tiri onyun fɔ, Yahwe e to wɔ, gɛ be kere wɔ bɛ ya. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be we gɛtɛ nka Isareli wogyu fɔ wɔlɛ, gɛ be kere wo geserenti berema bɛ ya. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Mɔ ɛkɩ ɛ tà wɔ gɩsɩnta ɛ sa bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ gɩ ma sere Isareli wogyu gɛgba fɔ gɩɩ gɛkyagakʋn gɩɩ gba gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ fɔ waanɩ. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ tiiramisan wɔkanlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Fi, fɔ àà ka mɩ ye akpa fɔ yaanɩ, yema na pira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Akpa fɔ ɩ mɛ ɔkɛma duwi fɔ powu daanɩ, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ ɛ̀ kpasa tiiramisan fɔ waanɩ, gɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ yɛ bù ten Aram bete fɔ ma ye ɔgyɔlɔ. Gɛ e ku ɔgyɔlɔ wʋtɔkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Gɛtɛ ofila wʋʋ nʋ̀n butu fɔ, afala i yera bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Eteni-kamasɛ e biri ɛ san wo ditele daanɩ, ma wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Okoro egyu fɔ e ku, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ ba Samariya, gɛ be lò wɔ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Gɛ bɛ ma fere wotiiramisan fɔ Samariya ditiribun daanɩ (ɔkʋn gɛtɛ fotoli bɛnanɩ bee ku fɔ), gɛ bɛkpɛɛ bɛ nʋnʋn wɔ nkalan, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi ɩ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Ahabi wade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, fɩya ma wo bugyu baanɩ baade-mɛlɛ powu, egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara gɛtɛ e sere, ma gɛtɛ ɛ ka etola dɩnya ɛ walɩ daanɩ, ma atele gɛtɛ ɛ sa yɩ ɔkɛma fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ baade-dɩrɛ yaakpa fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabi e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn, gɛ wobi Ahasiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehosafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Asa wobi Yehosafati e di bugyu Yuda, Isareli wogyu Ahabi gɩkyan-naafɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehosafati e di bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-ton, pɛ gɛ e di bugyu. Gɛ ɛ nya Yerusalem wo koro bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton. Wɔna diyere n di Asuba, Silihi wobi-nanɩbi fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Yehosafati ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ gɛ anlɛ wote. Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn. Mɔ en gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ̀ sangba bɛɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ bee kuma olifwi dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Gɛ olila wʋ̀ sara Yehosafati ma Isareli wogyu boo getite. <verse eid="1KI 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehosafati ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma wakpa gɛtɛ ɛ kpà powu, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Gɛ e tiri beteni ma bɛnanɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ afotoli-de akpen-kwo yaanɩ gɛtɛ be kuruma wote Asa bugyu bʋʋ gama fɔ powu. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Edom gɩfɩɩ gɩn ma egyu-dɩrɛ, okoro egyu wɔmalɛ gɛ Yuda wogyu e tiri ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya gii koro.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Fɔ Yehosafati ɛ mɛ gɩyɛ gɩɩ-ɩkʋlɩ gɛtɛ ì we anlɛ Tarisisi woyo fɔ, gɛtɛ yàà tɩ̀ san Ofiri, ɩ ma ka sɩka-sɩya, mɔ ɩn talɩ ɩ san, yema ɩ gbena Esiyon-Geberi ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ Ahabi wobi Ahasiya ɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ bàà tɩ̀ sara ma bɛnɩ ɔkʋlɩ fɔ fwaanɩ bɛ san.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Yehosafati e terema.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Yehosafati e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn Dafidi-Ditele daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Yehoram e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli wogyu Ahasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Yuda wogyu Yehosafati wɔ gɩkyan fwo-kwarankɩfɛ fɔ gaanɩ Ahabi wobi Ahasiya e di Isareli bugyu Samariya ditele daanɩ, gɛ ɛ nya Isareli wo koro bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn, yema ɛ tɛrɛma wote ma wɔna, ma Nebati wobi Yerobwam gɛtɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete be gyu ade-kpen yaanɩ fɔ boo-isele. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Ahasiya ɛ sʋma Baali, gɛ ɛ sa Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ owurufa, anlɛ gɛtɛ wote ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>